,'Say hello to iPhone 14 and the new, supersized iPhone 14 Plus. With awesome allâ€‘day battery life. Groundbreaking safety features designed to save lives. And even more spectacular lowâ€‘light shots.',19,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/7d/5d/7d5d09d15fcf77fbbe8a703c9731f469/2000x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7d\\/5d\\/7d5d09d15fcf77fbbe8a703c9731f469\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/cd\\/02\\/cd02ac8ff1594bdcb924786df26d6a19\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/76\\/84\\/76840ba678d5e9487c38f3a2d5aea05f\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/81\\/da\\/81dac4b7d083671c193e052fb7cddf2e\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/58\\/96\\/5896279d956b97719bc9ae423031fc75\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0a\\/4c\\/0a4c5b947f8bd37d83f692cc8a8dbd95\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/bc\\/7e\\/bc7e9e13e02f213365a6b3a99149bdf8\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":566.02,\"net\":679.22}',2,44,3473,22,'2025-08-20 14:14:47','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:44:57','2025-09-02 13:44:57'),(4327,'SM-G736BZKDEEB','SM-G736BZKDEEB','samsung-galaxy-xcover6-pro-168-cm-66-dual-sim-5g-usb-type-c-6-gb-128-gb-4050-mah-black','Samsung Galaxy Xcover6 Pro 16.8 cm (6.6\") Hybrid Dual SIM 5G USB Type-C 6 GB 128 GB 4050 mAh Black','Do more with confidence. Galaxy XCover6 Pro<br>Built to be durable, secure, and productive, Galaxy XCover6 Pro gives pros the confidence to do more in the field and beyond.<br><br>Awesome performance to do more at once<br>Galaxy Xcover6 Pro combines Octa-core processing power with 6GB of RAM for fast and efficient performance for the task at hand. Enjoy 128GB of internal storage and add up to 1TB more with microSD card.<br><br>Lightning speed wherever you go<br>The XCover6 Pro will keep you ahead. Out in the field or inside the office, the XCover6 Pro supports 5G as well as Wi-Fi 6E for hyper-fast connection anywhere, anytime.<br><br>Optimized display experience with large screen and super smooth scrolling.<br>Take in more, all at once. The Galaxy XCover6 Pro\'s 6.6-inch large Display gives you room to see and do more. With FHD+ technology and a 120Hz high refresh rate, the content you see every day will look smoother and sharper.<br><br>Durable to a new extent<br>The XCover6 Pro\'s IP68 water and dust-resistance rating and MIL-STD 810H-grade durability takes it anywhere you need to go.<br><br>Keep an extra life ready with replaceable battery<br>With its 4,050mAh (typical)*] replaceable battery, Galaxy XCover6 Pro gives you long-lasting power. When you need a quick power-up, either swap it out with a fully charged extra battery or use the 15W Fast Charging charger. Plus, you can get to charging quickly and conveniently with the POGO pin.<br><br>Seamless swiping in harsh conditions<br>Through rain, the XCover6 Pro will respond. With heightened touch sensitivity, the XCover6 Pro stays touch-responsive even when your hands are damp or when you\'ve got leather gloves on.<br><br>Protect what matters to you<br>Built into the phone\'s hardware and software from the start, Samsung Knox protects your phone from the minute it\'s turned on. Offering multi-layered security, it defends your most sensitive information from malware and malicious threats.<br><br>Customize your go-to key<br>Make your day easier. The XCover Key can be customized to fit your tasks and frequent uses by setting it for specific purposes, including Push-to-Talk, barcode scanning, certain apps and more.<br><br>Multi-task without the hassle<br>Take the office with you with DeX. The XCover6 Pro offers the convenient switch to a large screen from wherever the work takes you. Simply connect your device onto an external display and get to your PC tasks right away.<br><br>Stay connected in the field<br>Communication is clear and seamless with PTT on the XCover6 Pro. With the speaker volume now louder than ever, you can make sure you and your team are staying in sync on the job.<br><br>Scan-and-go with Knox Capture<br>With Knox Capture, your XCover6 Pro can readily become an enterprise-grade barcode scanner. Simply scan as you would take a picture and the captured barcode data are automatically integrated into your business apps.',185,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/57/73/57737bdc53aeb5c194547d952aa0c042/1053x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/57\\/73\\/57737bdc53aeb5c194547d952aa0c042\\/1053x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/57\\/77\\/5777bc0d6be6104606728ca3eed6c93d\\/298x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/41\\/41\\/4141ff4d33c5c86b374ef74463a0e9bb\\/965x204\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/37\\/e0\\/37e026f0d6133eecbbfab34e7dff697c\\/1053x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/db\\/be\\/dbbe91ace010e175bff5f6efbccc7533\\/1566x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0a\\/b2\\/0ab2977888671a36a267f77ae3056e7c\\/936x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/1c\\/42\\/1c42a08633f336554b3861834d8502d3\\/937x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/97\\/87\\/978798d3991c07f6ce23c9e3e55f135a\\/934x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/39\