sfer</b><br>Transfer movies, music, or an entire photo library quickly with 480 Mbps transfer speeds. Thanks to its certification, the cable links your iOS/iPadOSÂ® device properly to your USB-equipped computer, Mac, charger, hub, dock or other compatible device.<br><br><b>Strong shielding and heavy-duty jacket with flexible strain relief</b><br>The extremely durable molded PVC boot and jacket absorb the stress of frequent bends without damaging the core of the cable. They resist cracking and protect the cable from daily wear and tear or frequent in-car use. The double shielding (aluminum foil and braid) and corrosion-resistant contacts provide maximum signal integrity. Both plugs are reversible, so they will always fit, no matter which way you insert them.<br><br><b>Universal compatibility</b><br>This Manhattan cable is great for such different devices as the iPhone 12/13 Pro/Max/miniÂ®, iPhone 8/11/11 Pro, iPhone XR, iPad AirÂ®, iPad, iPad miniÂ®, AirPodsÂ®, Magic KeyboardÂ® / Magic TrackpadÂ® / Magic MouseÂ® and Siri RemoteÂ®. With an enabled iPad like the iPad ProÂ® 11-inch (1st generation) or later, you can even use the cable to charge an iPhone from your iPad.',155,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/ea/bd/eabdc0c51f7fc523554c41a70da8c03f/450x326/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ea\\/bd\\/eabdc0c51f7fc523554c41a70da8c03f\\/450x326\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0b\\/b4\\/0bb4551f7654ba3f2ec155fe92b1fa0e\\/450x301\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/fa\\/4d\\/fa4d7fe8614a596a58a3383f29ff2be1\\/450x395\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b6\\/f4\\/b6f49b000b3cda38b59c153d008be00a\\/450x301\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/4e\\/0e\\/4e0ef415e5d7c0b09b19a4f30d034d74\\/450x395\\/webp\\/resize?q