, charger, hub, dock or other compatible device.<br><br><b>Strong shielding and heavy-duty jacket with flexible strain relief</b><br>The extremely durable molded PVC boot and jacket absorb the stress of frequent bends without damaging the core of the cable. They resist cracking and protect the cable from daily wear and tear or frequent in-car use. The double shielding (aluminum foil and braid) and corrosion-resistant contacts provide maximum signal integrity. Both plugs are reversible, so they will always fit, no matter which way you insert them.<br><br><b>Universal compatibility</b><br>This Manhattan cable is great for such different devices as the iPhone 12/13 Pro/Max/miniÂ®, iPhone 8/11/11 Pro, iPhone XR, iPad AirÂ®, iPad, iPad miniÂ®, AirPodsÂ®, Magic KeyboardÂ® / Magic TrackpadÂ® / Magic MouseÂ® and Siri RemoteÂ®. With an enabled iPad like the iPad ProÂ® 11-inch (1st generation) or later, you can even use the cable to charge an iPhone from your iPad.',95,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/ea/bd/eabdc0c51f7fc523554c41a70da8c03f/450x326/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ea\\/bd\\/eabdc0c51f7fc523554c41a70da8c03f\\/450x326\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0b\\/b4\\/0bb4551f7654ba3f2ec155fe92b1fa0e\\/450x301\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/fa\\/4d\\/fa4d7fe8614a596a58a3383f29ff2be1\\/450x395\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b6\\/f4\\/b6f49b000b3cda38b59c153d008be00a\\/450x301\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/4e\\/0e\\/4e0ef415e5d7c0b09b19a4f30d034d74\\/450x395\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6c\\/eb\\/6ceb4f83e40f9284e65d0ab665cdf0ee\\/240x450\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":13.2,\"net\":15.84}',2,51,4012,22,'2025-08-20 14:14:56','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:45:47','2025-09-02 13:45:47'),(5305,'F4FPHN-2GR-EU1','F4FPHN-2GR-EU1','fairphone-4-16-cm-63-dual-sim-android-11-5g-usb-type-c-8-gb-256-gb-3905-mah-green','Fairphone 4 16 cm (6.3\") Dual SIM Android 11 5G USB Type-C 8 GB 256 GB 3905 mAh Green','<b>SUSTAINABLE. LONG-LASTING. FAIR.</b><br>Our most sustainable smartphone yet, now with 5G speed, 5-year warranty and electronic waste neutral.<br><br>A quality smartphone with fairness at its core<br>Sustainability has never been this powerful. Designed to last, with fair and recycled materials, the Fairphone 4 brings you 5G speed, with great battery life and a premium dual-camera - all backed by our 5-year warranty.<br><br>Love using your phone for longer<br><br>Yours to open, yours to keep<br>You donâ€™t need to be an expert to swap out the battery or display. No part of Fairphone 4 is glued shut, so you can choose to easily repair it yourself with a standard screwdriver. <br><br>How your phone is made, matters<br><br>Fairtrade Gold, recycled materials<br>Weâ€™re innovating where it counts. With Fairphone 4, weâ€™re pushing ourselves to the next level of fair by introducing even more materials that are responsibly sourced and conflict-free.<br>The phoneâ€™s body is machined from aluminium from certified vendors, with a 100% recycled plastic back cover. We\'re working behind the scenes to integrate fairer cobalt and lithium into our batteries and we\'re the only smartphone manufacturer with Fairtrade gold in our supply chain. Try that on for size.<br>And this is just the beginning of our journey.<br><br><b>Meet the makers</b><br>Bridging the gap between you and your technology is what weâ€™re all about. <br><br>Your phone and its materials have been handled hundreds of times by hundreds of people all across the world - They\'re more than an assembly line. Theyâ€™re the ones that bring it to life. <br><br>So with each Fairphone 4 we pay a living wage bonus to the factory workers. <br><br><b>Ready to use, ready for the future</b><br><br><b>Beautiful display of design</b><br>With its immersive 6.3inch Full HD+ display, smooth aluminium body and soft, recycled back cover the Fairphone 4 is a statement of industrial design, boldly unique in its look and feel.<br><br>This device is a challenge to the industry to rethink the modern smartphone: True innovation should be about solving problems, rather than creating new ones. This purpose of design shines through in every aspect of the Fairphone 4. Itâ€™s what makes it beautiful.<br><br><b>Super fast 5G speed</b><br>Video call your friends in HD, stream high-quality music and even download movies on the move. 5G opens up new possibilities.<br><br>No rush, get started with your existing SIM card and switch over when youâ€™re ready. Once you do, your Fairphone 4 will keep you 5G-connected throughout Europe. Fairphone 4 even provides the flexibility to use two SIM cards, introducing an e-SIM slot for an additional number.<br><br><b>Android 11, enjoy every moment</b><br>With its powerful processor, large amount of expandable storage and great battery life the Fairphone 4 is ready whenever you need it. Our clean version of Android also keeps things intuitive and simple, yet very customisable. <br><br>Quick and easy to set up, transfer everything you need from your old phone and your favorite apps from the Google Play Store.<br><br>Make it yours to enjoy!<br><br><b>Focusing on whatâ€™s important</b><br><br><b>Dual cameras for the win</b><br>The Fairphone 4 dual cameras are the real deal. A pair of premium lenses for all the details or the bigger picture.<br><br>Add a light sensor for blazing fast autofocus and top it off with optical image stabilization for uncompromising image quality. And that counts for the buttery smooth 4K video as well, of course.<br><br><b>High-pixel to capture lifeâ€™s details</b><br>The 48MP quality main lens and carefully dialed in image processing make for an intuitive, effortless camera experience. The Fairphone 4 lets you focus on what matters most: Image quality in every frame and setting. Capture true to life colors, in great detail, every time.<br><br><b>Ultrawide to expand your horizons</b><br>The best camera is the one you have with you. This one also has a tack-sharp 48MP ultra-wide lens that lives up to its name with an immersive 120Â° viewing angle. Expand your horizon and get the bigger picture.<br><br><b>Explore your world in high definition</b><br>Whether youâ€™re video calling your family, sharing a special moment with your friends or documenting a memorable trip, these camerasâ€™ got your back.<br><br>The advanced image stabilization and highly dialed-in image processing give you the freedom to explore and never worry about missing that clip, no matter the scene.<br><br><b>Your life, your memories, your camera</b><br>We designed the camera app to give you the freedom to focus on the shot. You can customize it to match your style and have all your favorite features at your fingertips.<br><br><b>No waste, no worries</b><br><br><b>Fairphone 4 is electronic waste neutral</b><br>We go one step further to conserve the precious materials used in manufacturing electronic products. When you buy a Fairphone 4, we responsibly recycle or give one old phone a second life.<br><br>This means 100% compensation for the material we put into the market. This is first in the smartphone industry and itâ€™s exactly the kind of dedication you wonâ€™t find anywhere else!',3,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/bf/e6/bfe65847755a917328375d994ac82f84/700x700/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/bf\\/e6\\/bfe65847755a917328375d994ac82f84\\/700x700\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/10\\/cb\\/10cb9fd3d7ada8074840057f2915fce4\\/700x700\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d6\