 color tonality, bursting out on an expansive 6.6\" HD+ display. <br><br><b>Theatre-like viewing.</b><br>Dive into all-new immersion while playing and streaming. <br><br><b>Dual stereo speakers.</b><br>Browse online, stream videos or music and take video calls with thumping, crystal-clear stereo vibes. <br><br><b>Versatile eye care.</b><br><br><b>Low Blue Light Filter.</b><br>More protection and eye comfort while preserving the original color tones.<br><br><b>E-book time with grayscale tones.</b><br>Relax your eyes while reading and preserving battery life.<br><br><b>Longer battery life with the<br>Smart Manager.</b><br>Two dedicated saving modes to keep the battery power going for longer during critical moments. <br><br><b>Extra power saver.</b><br>A Smart Manager app instantly cleans up the memory and blocks apps and notifications when you want to preserve your battery power. <br><br><b>Intelligent charging mode.</b><br>The battery powers up overnight to its fullest capacity just before you wake up.<br><br><b>Time-tested performance.</b><br>Designed to perform without any major degradation that might compromise a userâ€™s resource-intensive  multitasking. <br><br><b>Accelerated multitasking. </b><br>Keep many apps open and flip between them, as well as tabs and slides. Take non-latent video calls with the deeply optimized Hyper Engine chipset.<br><br><b>Artfulness in portraits.</b><br>Gently blur the background and portray yourself with natural skin color tonality. <br><br><b>Time-stopping HDR sceneries.</b><br>Catch the early morning hues or the last evening rays behind you. <br><br><b>Enjoy effortless selfies.</b><br>5MP AI-powered front lens that uses Auto Focus without button pressing. <br><br><b>Take hands-free shots.</b><br>Auto Capture Mode intuitively tracks your hand gestures to take a shot after a 2-second beep count.  <br><br><b>Secure Face Unlock.</b><br>Made easy and instant, for comfort and security.<br><br> <br>',195,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/b9