.<br><br><b>HIGH-RES PERSPECTIVE</b><br>With a 64 MP camera, your photos are consistently clear and bright with razor-sharp details, even when taken in low light.<br><br><b>FRAME YOUR VISION</b><br>Fit 4x more in the frame for ultra-wide photos, draw subjects 4x nearer for extreme close-ups, and add focal point depth for creative portraits.<br><br><b>STUNNING SELFIES</b><br>High-resolution selfies with Quad Pixel technology combine four pixels into one for better low-light sensitivity.<br><br><b>THE POWER IS YOURS STAY IN THE FAST LANE</b><br>Connect at 5G speed without worrying about battery life on a 4020 mAh battery. And get power for the day in just 10 minutes with 68 W TurboPowerâ„¢ charging.<br><br><b>POWER UNTETHERED</b><br>Avoid messy cables and cords with wireless charging.',12,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/05/9f/059f4d96bafa91c00d47b76df1e86b44/1200x1200/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/05\\/9f\\/059f4d96bafa91c00d47b76df1e86b44\\/1200x1200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/f4\\/71\\/f471dde40d71a8585b9b5348b5e42884\\/1200x1200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d5\\/af\\/d5afac2aeedc49aab750d4f04b631806\\/1200x1200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/42\\/47\\/4247d95a6028958ce0af79c276354093\\/1200x1200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ec\\/da\\/ecda65ce9caf7c8484673637d571915d\\/1200x1200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e9\\/60\\/e960873d7def37e9aa86992aab3dee23\\/178x200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":267.79,\"net\":321.35}',2,105,5399,22,'2025-08-20 14:14:47','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:48:49','2025-09-02 13:48:49'),(8767,'394505','394505','manhattan-usb-c-to-lightning-cab