ing (aluminum foil and braid) and corrosion-resistant contacts provide maximum signal integrity. Both plugs are reversible, so they will always fit, no matter which way you insert them.<br><br><b>Universal compatibility</b><br>This Manhattan cable is great for such different devices as the iPhone 12/13 Pro/Max/miniÂ®, iPhone 8/11/11 Pro, iPhone XR, iPad AirÂ®, iPad, iPad miniÂ®, AirPodsÂ®, Magic KeyboardÂ® / Magic TrackpadÂ® / Magic MouseÂ® and Siri RemoteÂ®. With an enabled iPad like the iPad ProÂ® 11-inch (1st generation) or later, you can even use the cable to charge an iPhone from your iPad.',71,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/ea/bd/eabdc0c51f7fc523554c41a70da8c03f/450x326/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ea\\/bd\\/eabdc0c51f7fc523554c41a70da8c03f\\/450x326\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0b\\/b4\\/0bb4551f7654ba3f2ec155fe92b1fa0e\\/450x301\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/fa\\/4d\\/fa4d7fe8614a596a58a3383f29ff2be1\\/450x395\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b6\\/f4\\/b6f49b000b3cda38b59c153d008be00a\\/450x301\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/4e\\/0e\\/4e0ef415e5d7c0b09b19a4f30d034d74\\/450x395\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6c\\/eb\\/6ceb4f83e40f9284e65d0ab665cdf0ee\\/240x450\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":11.89,\"net\":14.27}',2,51,4012,22,'2025-08-20 14:14:56','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:49:51','2025-09-02 13:49:51'),(9717,'F5FPHN-2ZW-EU1','F5FPHN-2ZW-EU1','fairphone-5-164-cm-646-dual-sim-android-13-5g-usb-type-c-8-gb-256-gb-4200-mah-black-4-and-more-bar-256gb-and-more-5g-android-13-android-black-6gb-and-more-dual-camera-dual-sim-f5fphn-2zw-eu1','Fairphone 5 16.4 cm (6.46\") 