r smooth handheld videos<br><br><b>Action ready<br>NEXT LEVEL STABILIZATION</b><br>Whether youâ€™re filming while hiking up a rocky trail or chasing your kids through the park, the advanced stabilization guarantees buttery smooth handheld videos.<br><br><b>All the functionality you need</b><br><b>FAST, POWERFUL, RELIABLE - FOR YEARS TO COME.<br>INTUITIVE ANDROIDâ„¢ 13</b><br>A state-of-the-art user experience thatâ€™s yours to customize and yours to control. With added security. And it comes with zero bloatware, as clean as Android gets. Make it your own.<br><br><b>DYNAMIC OLED SCREEN</b><br>Stunning picture quality with super smooth motion performance - bright and vibrant even in direct sunlight. Itâ€™s made with durable Corning Gorilla Glass and itâ€™s easily replaceable.<br><br><b>SUPER FAST 5G SPEED</b><br>Introducing 5G speed. Video call your friends and family in HD, stream your music instantly and watch your movies on the move. Super fast speed thatâ€™s also future-proof.<br><br><b>DUAL SIM</b><br>Enjoy the flexibility of dual SIM functionality. Balance your work with one SIM and your private life with an e-SIM, or keep in touch with loved ones abroad. You have options.<br><br><b>ALL-DAY BATTERY LIFE, MADE FAIR</b><br>Combining all-day power (4200mAh) and fast-charging. Plus, itâ€™s easy to swap when you need it, so you can keep going and going and going. And itâ€™s as fair as batteries get.<br>- 32 hours of daily use<br>- Recharge to 50% in 20 minutes<br>- Replace it in seconds <br><br><b>Make the switch to Fairphone</b><br><br><b>SWITCHING FROM IOS OR ANDROID IS EASIER THAN YOU THINK</b><br>- Switch from iOS or Android in no time<br>- Securely transfer all your data<br>- All of your favorite Google Apps will be right there with you<br>- Fairphones work with your devices: PCs, Macbooks, headphones, even iPads',16,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/2e/4d/2e4dfc4dcd55b9e908955c7bb39ac143/1024x1024/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/imag