hone from scratches and drops.',8,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/d2/81/d281699d9b09605dc5c535e6a4c496f5/1000x1000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d2\\/81\\/d281699d9b09605dc5c535e6a4c496f5\\/1000x1000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/5d\\/57\\/5d57e3195202b926c32edb2a3455c33b\\/1000x1000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/69\\/4c\\/694cdfe1c6ba948635ba1b8f4bda6bda\\/1000x1000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e7\\/4f\\/e74fb9285a3785300444844058f080eb\\/1000x1000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b4\\/d3\\/b4d381ae947fbdbb9c1a9cab13f8bd37\\/1000x1000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/01\\/e8\\/01e881786568542449adb21a86cdcbac\\/1000x1000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":29.39,\"net\":35.27}',2,44,6339,22,'2025-08-20 14:15:34','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:52:38','2025-09-02 13:52:38'),(11472,'T771K3-2ALCA112','T771K3-2ALCA112','tcl-40-nxtpaper-5g-168-cm-66-hybrid-dual-sim-android-13-usb-type-c-6-gb-256-gb-5000-mah-black-256gb-and-more-5g-android-triple-camera-hybrid-dual-sim-6gb-and-more-android-13-black-bar-4-and-more-40-t771k3-2alca112','TCL 40 NXTPAPER 5G 16.8 cm (6.6\") Hybrid Dual SIM Android 13 USB Type-C 6 GB 256 GB 5000 mAh Black','<b>Reimagine what you see.</b><br>Immerse yourself in the latest innovation-driven NXTPAPER visual technology for a fresh and novel experience.<br>Enjoy vivid visuals on the expansive 6.6\" screen with HD+ clarity and silky-smooth 90Hz refresh rate.<br><br><b>Delicate comfort.<br>Paper joy.</b><br>With innovative design, built-in multiple layers deliver advanced features for versatile eye protection.<br><br><b>Paper-like touch</b><br>Experience a paper-like feeling once you touch the screen texture with an anti-fingermark matte finish that captures the joy of real paper.<br><br><b>Low blue light</b><br>Significantly removing harmful blue light at the hardware level while keeping natural color tonality, without undesired yellowing.<br><br><b>Anti-glare</b>  <br>The screen is certified for a reflection-free viewing, ensuring clarity and gentleness while commuting, traveling and using outdoors thanks to the anti-glare feature at any angle.<br><br><b>Say goodbye to tired eyes.<br><br>Full-color</b><br>Delight in an explosion of colors on the paper-like display while reading graphic novels, making video calls, or browsing the web.<br><br><b>Optimized color temperature</b><br>No matter what are the surrounding lighting conditions, the NXTPAPER screen automatically adjusts to the most suitable color temperature and more eye-friendly brightness.<br><br><b>Soft light</b><br>Uncompromised comfort with softly dimmed screen light for bedtime viewing in low-lit environments.<br><br><b>Relax your eyes with NXTPAPER UI</b><br>The nature-themed and forest-embraced UI elements offer restful all-day visual effects for soothing viewing.<br><br><b>Unique modes</b><br>Dedicated UI modes provide comfortable reading or usage outdoors as well as in low-lit environments.<br><br><b>Massive memory for all your needs.<br><br>6GB + 6GB RAM expansion</b><br>The additional 6GB virtual RAM will help you run multiple apps simultaneously and enjoy lag-free streaming and browsing on the AndroidTM 13.<br><br><b>Ample 256GB memory</b><br>Store everything you need with the massive 256GB memory, capable of holding 110+ movies or 50,000 photos.<br><br><b>Extra power kick with NXTURBO.</b><br>Visual processing power with NXTURBO, accelerates image rendering by up to 30% for even smoother gaming, scrolling through video channels and web browsing.<br><br><b>Higher energy efficiency</b><br>Reducing power consumption by up to 17%.<br><br><b>Fast and smooth</b><br>Ultimate 5G performance for daily tasks, high-quality streaming, gaming, and browsing.<br><br><b>A battery you can count on.</b><br>Enjoy all-day high-performance and online entertainment on a single charge.<br><br><b>5000mAh</b><br>Powerful battery<br><br><b>Intelligent charging</b><br>The phone delays charging past 80% until you are about to wake up. This preserves energy and extends the batteryâ€™s lifespan.<br><br><b>Capture your world.</b><br><br><b>50MP AI triple camera</b><br>Effortlessly explore high-resolution and low-lit photography using the intuitive AI features.<br><br><b>AI Color Video</b><br>Be the center of attention whenever you want with an original black and white background behind you.<br><br><b>One Shot</b><br>Produce effortless photo sessions of your best shots with just one click.<br><br><b>Vlogs</b><br>Express your life with richer colors and brighter details, even in areas of low-light places and at all times.<br><br><b>8MP Selfies</b><br>Always ready to take the best of you the way you want.<br><br><b>In harmony with nature\'s rhythm.</b><br>Refined with pebble-smooth rounded corners and camera design lines elegantly unified under solid fiberglass.<br><br><b>Starlight Black</b><br>Bringing an elegant simplicity with a timeless and sleek look.<br><br><b>More convenience.<br><br>NFC</b><br>Fast and seamless connectivity.<br><br><b>Fingerprint sensor</b><br>Side-mounted.<br><br><b>Face unlock</b><br>Secure and convenient.',27,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/7d/3f/7d3f5012076a77eca7b2c65af75846bd/1554x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7d\\/3f\\/7d3f5012076a77eca7b2c65af75846bd\\/1554x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ec\\/55\\/ec553db6f1a97f6487f0b0e37659b56e\\/1333x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/89\\/bf\\/89bf6b717fa9ddbfaeed015ee2589959\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/re