750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/10\\/25\\/102505e271499df88f603ea2e9e21f30\\/750x750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6d\\/36\\/6d36de2b431e67d708f60ec4ee4fcc5c\\/750x750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/cb\\/be\\/cbbefaa941580e2ef68702c1d9d83125\\/750x750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a6\\/71\\/a6716a2843a52730f9b1f3064aac69e5\\/750x750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/29\\/7c\\/297cdf9d2f2069f90064c6e065e82c36\\/750x750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/bd\\/d2\\/bdd23201087f3e1613e347ee3f5e6709\\/750x750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c8\\/6f\\/c86f59924a2c518b8110d49839700401\\/750x750\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":262.3,\"net\":314.76}',2,168,7264,22,'2025-08-20 14:15:43','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:52:47','2025-09-02 13:52:47'),(11479,'SM-G556BZKDEEB','SM-G556BZKDEEB','samsung-galaxy-xcover7-enterprise-edition-168-cm-66-dual-sim-android-14-5g-usb-type-c-6-gb-128-gb-4050-mah-black-128gb-to-256gb-5g-android-single-camera-6gb-and-more-dual-sim-android-14-black-bar-4-and-more-galaxy-xcover7-sm-g556bzkdeeb','Samsung Galaxy XCover7 Enterprise Edition 16.8 cm (6.6\") Dual SIM Android 14 5G USB Type-C 6 GB 128 GB 4050 mAh Black','Outstanding performance to do more at once<br>Galaxy XCover7 combines Octa-core processing power with 6GB of Memory for fast and efficient performance for the task at hand. Enjoy 128GB of internal storage and add up to 1TB more with microSD card.<br><br>Lightning speed wherever you go<br>Never miss a thing, wherever you are, with the Galaxy XCover7. Tap into hyper-fast connectivity with 5G<sup>[1]</sup> , making it easier to access the vital data or information you need to carry out tasks in the field.<br><br>See every detail, work effortlessly<br>The expansive 6.6\" FHD+ display gives you ample space to view and read with ease. Plus, the 500-nit brightness allows for good visibility even in bright conditions.<br><br>Makes the rough, smooth<br>The Galaxy XCover7 is like the superhero of rugged phones. It\'s built to MIL-STD-810H standards<sup>[2]</sup> , handling everything from bumps and scrapes to dusty environments. It can even survive drops onto steel from an impressive height of 1.5m.<br><br>Touchscreen built for hands-on work<br>With its high touch sensitivity, Galaxy XCover7 seamlessly responds to your touch for a smooth workflow even out in the field.<br><br>Battery that doesn\'t slow you down<br>Keep the momentum going with the long-lasting 4,050mAh battery. When it\'s running low, power up quickly and easily with 15W Fast Charging and POGO charger. Or simply replace it with an extra battery and keep up the pace.<br><br>Built for security, customised for productivity<br>Look out for your invaluable assets. Galaxy XCover7 is offered with up to 4 generations of OS upgrades and up to 5 years of security updates to keep your device running smooth and your data properly safeguarded by Samsung Knox.<br><br>Make the most of your go-to key<br>Specialised to expedite your day. Customise your XCover Key to save unnecessary steps in getting done your most frequent tasks and routines. Set the go-to key with specific actions including launching designated apps, quick barcode scanning with Knox Capture and more.<br><br>Maximised frontline workers productivity<br>Empower your workforce with intelligent persona-driven efficiency<br>Whereas its Maintenance Technicians, Inventory Clerks or Safety Engineers, SAP Service and Asset Manager covers the main processes and services required with optimised functions on Galaxy XCover7.<br><br>Makes the rough, smooth<br>Plus, it can handle regular sanitising to ensure a clean work environment<sup>[3]</sup>. Whether you\'re in a bustling office or out in the field, rest assured, your XCover7 can handle whatever you throw at it.<br><br>Scan-and-go with Knox Capture<br>With Knox Capture, Galaxy XCover7 can readily become an enterprise-grade barcode scanner. Simply scan as you would take a picture and the captured barcode data are automatically integrated into your business apps.<br><br>Maximised frontline workers productivity<br>Boost efficiency for store staff<br>Whereas its a Store Manager or Associate, SAP In-Store Merchandising apps allow to fulfill key required functionalities of store employees with optimised functions on Galaxy XCover7.',22,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/ea/ca/eaca5eb027165255541898f35cd122c6/2000x1333/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ea\\/ca\\/eaca5eb027165255541898f35cd122c6\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b0\\/47\\/b047c6ee89d4d36d7aac2a712ea1a7a3\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/4a\\/a0\\/4aa09256abca5e5aca72c7fd993c7dc1\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ab\\/e3\\/abe3fcdc3f88176c823fa0c103ae5eb3\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/9a\\/e3\\/9ae33c1e90dd29486b6a50f780bfd01e\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/af\\/60\\/af604613737c9923550b43b45222044f\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d8\\/7a\\/d87ad2853a019d0b26448b255e644352\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/da\\/49\\/da49045b49503ad80434267a417ae2b8\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize