28GB internal storage, Galaxy A05s is equipped with the performance capacity for seamless gaming, viewing, and sharing on social media.<br><br>Power that keeps you going<br>The 5,000mAh (typical)**] battery gives you more time to do what you loveâ€”streaming, sharing, gaming and more. And with up to 25W of Super Fast Charging, Galaxy A05s gets back to full power, quickly.<br><br>Side Fingerprint Sensor<br>Your security, double-checked by the side fingerprint sensor accessible only by your fingerprint.<br><br>Plug-in and save up<br>Here for when you need it. The 3.5mm earphone jack is a simple solution always ready for a trusty pair.<br><br>Smart Switch<br>Start right where you left off on your new Samsung Galaxy device with a simple transfer.<br><br>One UI<br>Give your Samsung Galaxy a look thats more you and make it function your way with One UI.<br><br>Samsung Members<br>Get tips and tricks to unlock your devices full potential.',799,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/c0/6b/c06bb915c10209c93d9d788dc8ae075b/300x137/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c0\\/6b\\/c06bb915c10209c93d9d788dc8ae075b\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b8\\/13\\/b81367a4e27a95e31568514232da920c\\/1606x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6e\\/f2\\/6ef22f28f6120c737176ee7c6f32f7b0\\/914x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b1\\/1e\\/b11ec453634138fc5002ca05cecaa442\\/660x1940\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/07\\/f8\\/07f89fabf32b1658ab5578dcb7d38118\\/975x1895\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/85\\/3b\\/853b58b83cf34b0e9e7eed26d753f607\\/912x1997\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0e\\/f4\\/0ef468