alaxy S24 and S24+. And Galaxy S24+ comes with the highest screen resolution on a Galaxy device: QHD+.<br><br>Get the details on Camera<br>Whether you\'re snapping a super sweet selfie, shooting wide angle pics or zooming in, these cameras will help ensure you leave with a pixel-perfect shot.<br><br>50MP. Mega Mega Pixels<br>A true pixel powerhouse that will not disappoint. Ever. Snap high-res pics for that will no doubt withstand the test of time for years to come.<br><br>Shoot far. Even in the dark<br>Capture bright, colourful, clear photos, even in the dark with AI ISP. Finally, the portraits you\'ve been dreaming of. Zoom in 2x, or even 3x â€”Â it doesn\'t really matter. Each distance can be as clear as day even though it\'s technically night.<br><br>Get closer with every pinch<br>Just keep pinching. Go from 1x to 2x or even 3x. AI keeps pictures high-quality: crisp, clear and super sharp â€” without losing much detail.<br><br>Stronger Vapor Chamber. Game on<br>\'This new and improved heat dissipation system helps you keep gaming at optimal performance. Our latest Vapor Chamber is bigger than before, with an integrated liquid-type thermal interface material.<br><br>The all-day battery is smarter for longer<br>Power on. And on. And on. Galaxy S24 and S24+ have an intelligent battery that gives you more game time, watch time and you time.<br><br>Our brightest adaptive mobile display under the sun<br>Level up your game with these two massive screens. With increased display size and ultra-slim bezels, Galaxy S24\'s 6.2\" FHD+ display and Galaxy S24+\'s 6.7\" QHD+ display offer more screen real estate than ever before. Plus, enjoy optimal colour and contrast with Vision Booster on both displays.<br><br>Quick Share outside your ecosystem<br>You\'re not limited to Galaxy phones. Use QR codes and saved contacts to share with iOS users or far-away friends and family.<br><br>Switch effortlessly from iOS<br>Keep your photos, videos, contacts, calendar and apps with Smart Switch â€” even if you switch from iOS.',3,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/3d/6b/3d6bbfcd52a64c209d2881179c30a698/300x137/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/3d\\/6b\\/3d6bbfcd52a64c209d2881179c30a698\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/1e\\/2a\\/1e2acfad03cd6979af2d5b5361a8ce78\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/71\\/dc\\/71dcad69aeb916244b9e65d945b0a92a\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/68\\/2d\\/682d5cf2b27844a1777ebd18f490b085\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6d\\/91\\/6d91ee258e146572320059b0cc08b851\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e2\\/34\\/e23463f6fa63fe536765b36643ca060f\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ed\\/f8\\/edf8023f9585aac28aad8cabaaef9f4d\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7f\\/b2\\/7fb2078ea851b52a312fd6833dcb6f1a\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/bb\\/40\\/bb407b7470f7130078ab24cb64e08168\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/52\\/fa\\/52fa6cdb16c5d10a1d9b83f1df0f6a75\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":824.95,\"net\":989.94}',2,26,7294,22,'2025-08-20 14:15:59','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:52:51','2025-09-02 13:52:51'),(11582,'SM-S926BZADEUB','SM-S926BZADEUB','samsung-galaxy-s24-17-cm-67-dual-sim-5g-usb-type-c-12-gb-256-gb-4900-mah-grey-bar-android-triple-camera-256gb-and-more-5g-grey-6gb-and-more-dual-sim-4-and-more-galaxy-s24-sm-s926bzadeub','Samsung Galaxy S24+ 