>Whether you\'re typing up a storm or jotting something down, Note Assist makes a long story short. Simply start writing, and format it into a clear, easy-to-review summary later. And when you\'re looking for an old note, the new covers show simple summaries â€” keeping your screen looking organised.<br><br>Resize it, Retouch it. Just like that<br>Something out of place? Just move it in post. New AI-powered editing options let you get the photo you wanted, like relocating objects and intelligently filling in the space they left behind.<br><br>Armour up with titanium<br>Check out the upgrade â€” a durable shield of titanium built right into the frame. CorningÂ® GorillaÂ® Armour helps protect your screen from scratches to keep your device looking beautiful. And don\'t let water dampen your spirits. Galaxy S24 Ultra is IP68 water and dust resistant.<br><br>Built-in S Pen writes a whole new chapter<br>The legacy of Galaxy Note is alive and well. Write, tap and navigate with precision your fingers wish they had on the new, flat display.<br><br>200MP. Capture details that rival reality<br>With the most megapixels on a smartphone and AI processing, Galaxy S24 Ultra sets the industry standard for image quality every time you hit the shutter. What\'s more, the new ProVisual engine recognises objects â€” improving colour tone, reducing noise and bringing out detail.<br><br>Our most powerful Quad Tele zoom yet<br>Dont let long distance get you down. Now you can get 2x, 3x, 5x and even 10x close-ups with optical or optical quality zoom. Plus, the new, powerful Tele OIS is wider than before to stabilise the shot for less zoom-in blur.<br><br>ProVisual engine shoots every night in clear detail<br>Space Zoom puts you in the middle of the action, even at night. With 1.6x larger pixels and a wider Tele OIS, photos and videos are brighter and more stable â€” making even distant subjects clearly stunning.<br><br>Our most hyper-realistic mobile gameplay yet<br>Victory can be yours with SnapdragonÂ® 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy. Faster processing gives you the power you need for all the gameplay you want. Manifest hyper-realistic shadows and reflections with ray tracing. Then get improved performance and heat dissipation with a Vapor Chamber nearly doubled in size.<br><br>All-day battery to play on and on<br>With massive capacity and greater energy efficiency, Ultra\'s battery gives you extra life when it matters most â€”Â you know, like the epic boss battle you\'ve been gearing up for.<br><br>2600 nit display. Our brightest adaptive mobile display under the sun<br>Our most immersive display comes with some major visibility upgrades. CorningÂ® GorillaÂ® Armour reduces reflections and improves visual clarity, even in direct sunlight. Then, an improved Vision Booster enhances contrast and colour for a clearly exceptional experience.<br><br>Quick Share outside your ecosystem<br>You\'re not limited to Galaxy phones. Use QR codes and saved contacts to share with iOS users or far-away friends and family.<br><br>Switch effortlessly from iOS<br>Keep your photos, videos, contacts, calendar and apps with Smart Switch â€” even if you switch from iOS.',1,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/3d/6b/3d6bbfcd52a64c209d2881179c30a698/300x137/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/3d\\/6b\\/3d6bbfcd52a64c209d2881179c30a698\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/2d\\/0c\\/2d0cdf01928ea24fb0fdcd3789421d59\\/1383x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/97\\/b2\\/97b2046723ff115bb78e96ff5b56d4ba\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/dc\\/4a\\/dc4a90309dab97e91ef8dad5a044f08a\\/1205x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b8\\/31\\/b831c546fd7b295c03ff518836135efd\\/1205x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&co