 highest screen resolution on a Galaxy device: QHD+.<br><br>Get the details on Camera<br>Whether you\'re snapping a super sweet selfie, shooting wide angle pics or zooming in, these cameras will help ensure you leave with a pixel-perfect shot.<br><br>50MP. Mega Mega Pixels<br>A true pixel powerhouse that will not disappoint. Ever. Snap high-res pics that will withstand the test of time for years to come.<br><br>Shoot far. Even in the dark<br>Capture bright, colourful, clear photos, even in the dark with AI ISP. Finally, the portraits you\'ve been dreaming of. Zoom in 2x, or even 3x â€”Â it doesn\'t really matter. Each distance can be as clear as day even though it\'s technically night.<br><br>Get closer with every pinch<br>Just keep pinching. Go from 1x to 2x or even 3x. AI keeps pictures high-quality: crisp, clear and super sharp â€” without losing much detail.<br><br>Stronger Vapor Chamber. Game on<br>This new and improved heat dissipation system helps you keep gaming at optimal performance. Our latest Vapor Chamber is bigger than before, with an integrated liquid-type thermal interface material.<br><br>The all-day battery is smarter for longer<br>Power on. And on. And on. Galaxy S24 and S24+ have an intelligent battery that gives you more game time, watch time and you time.<br><br>Our brightest adaptive mobile display under the sun<br>Level up your game with these two massive screens. With increased display size and ultra-slim bezels, Galaxy S24\'s 6.2\" FHD+ display and Galaxy S24+\'s 6.7\" QHD+ display offer more screen real estate than ever before. Plus, enjoy optimal colour and contrast with Vision Booster on both displays.<br><br>Quick Share outside your ecosystem<br>You\'re not limited to Galaxy phones. Use QR codes and saved contacts to share with iOS users or far-away friends and family.<br><br>Switch effortlessly from iOS<br>Keep your photos, videos, contacts, calendar and apps with Smart Switch â€” even if you switch from iOS.',52,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/3d/6b/3d6bbfcd52a64c209d2881179c30a698/300x137/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/3d\\/6b\\/3d6bbfcd52a64c209d2881179c30a698\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e7\\/dd\\/e7ddad0061efd5d05b5c4d453b013229\\/365x292\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ce\\/d7\\/ced7e0259bcae2ffecb47ee621f63870\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0c\\/c5\\/0cc565bd20741322577ff0573904929b\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/1b\\/a6\\/1ba6752f68b8e6a79bd815cd793d72fb\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c6\\/30\\/c630e7f2421902e4c3b379600dfcae13\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/31\\/8c\\/318c7ecce18d1ddbadfd5146ed655a24\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/90\\/16\\/90160e01b04fee7c55307fe0b201d908\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/69\\/3c\\/693c023d8433904ef779cc4643e5814f\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/2d\\/03\\/2d0389b5639f0b0095d49c56bd74db46\\/684x547\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/3c\\/b3\\/3cb39f819f2fb5437dda884a2cad0249\\/200x120\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":529,\"net\":634.8}',2,26,7294,22,'2025-08-20 14:15:59','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 13:53:41','2025-09-02 13:53:41'),(13946,'OCUIPHONES14CZ','OCUIPHONES14CZ','ocushield-anti-blue-light-screen-protector-anti-glare-screen-protector-apple-1-pcs-apple-ocuiphones14cz','Ocushield Anti Blue Light Screen Protector Anti-glare screen protector Apple 1 pc(s)','<b>BLUE LIGHT SHIELD FOR IPHONES</b><br>Whatâ€™s that all about?<br>Blue light is a segment of the visible light spectrum responsible for keeping you alert. Itâ€™s naturally present in sunlight, but is also concentrated in the light that comes out of your digital devices â€” phones, tablets, laptops, everything! And thatâ€™s not a good thing.<br><br><b>Blue light, it\'s a modern day menace</b><br>Blue light penetrates your retinas, giving your brain a morning cue that itâ€™s time to wake up and seize the day. But extended exposure to blue light can have a significant impact on our wellbeing â€” headaches, eye irritation and fatigue are all common symptoms of blue light exposure.<br><br>Plus, by restricting the production of melatonin (a chemical which helps us sleep), blue light disrupts your natural sleep cycle causing you to feel lethargic, irritable and unproductive. You may be excited about buying that iPhone 13 or 14 Pro Max, but yikes!<br><br><b>Thatâ€™s why we created blue light screen protectors for iPhone</b><br>Ocushield blue light filters block harmful blue light before it reaches your eyes. This keeps your eyes feeling fresh, diminishing dryness and enabling longer periods of focus.<br><br>Developed by qualified optometrists, our MHRA & FDA registered anti blue light filters block up to 99% of harmful UV and blue light emissions between 300-400nm, and up to 54% of harmful blue light between 400-470nm.<br><br>By reducing your exposure to blue light in the evenings, Ocushield blue light filters will help you get to sleep peacefully and boost the quality of your sleep, and let your worries about blue light slip away.<br><br><b>5x stronger protection than the competition.</b><br>The OcushieldÂ® tempered glass screen protector is five times stronger versus other screen protectors on the market, and guards your phone screen from cracks when you drop it, offering you shock absorbant security that protects your phone from damage.<br><br>Our premium screen protector is super thin to boost display quality, and is made from reinforced 9H tempered glass, equivalent to alumnicatine, better known as gorilla glass. Our protectors are compatible with all iPhone screens, including the iPhone XR, 10, 11, 12, 13 and 14 ranges.<br><br>OcushieldÂ® offers both your eyes and your phone unrivalled protection when using your technology. Oil resistant and anti reflection coating stops pesky fingerprint marks as well as glare from interrupting a perfect display.<br><br><b>Recommended by professionals</b><br><br>OcushieldÂ® is recommended by leading Eye Doctor Joseph Allen - also known as Dr Eye Health.<br><br>He recommends OcushieldÂ® as his favourite blue filter on the market to prevent harmful blue light from screens entering your eyes.<br><br><b>Whatâ€™s in the blue light iphone screen protector package?</b><br>- Anti-blue light screen protector (tempered glass, wonâ€™t affect screen colours)<br>- Micro fibre cloth + dust removers<br>- Easy applicator tray<br>- Full instructions',39,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/a3/d5/a3d5348f7c4ffe12100b5e65716727d8/720x514/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a3\\/d5\\/a3d5348f7c4ffe12100b5e65716727d8\\/720x514\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/93\\/2f\\/932f7268cadaf21fae651c902fc9916f\\/720x514\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/75\\/9f\\/759f3d566d1be703cc0c98e56c37685f\\/720x514\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/8d\\/35\\/8d35f166516b6d6c2d03e88221a28686\\/720x514\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/0e\\/e1\\/0ee194bd9f1967c82c809ea8ae29c8fe\\/720x514\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c2\\/3d\\/c23d8c85b6b65a2efa8