Â® Glass VictusÂ®+ to give you additional peace of mind.<br><br>Built to keep your passwords secure<br>Samsung Knox Vault is like a safe within a safe, physically isolating PINS, passwords and other private info so hackers cant gain access.<br><br>Built to last with 4x OS upgrades<br>OS updates and security maintenance come standard with your Galaxy A35 5G. You\'ll get up to 4 generations of OS upgrades and up to 5 years of security updates to keep your phone and personal data in good hands.<br><br>Smart Switch<br>Easily transfer data to your new Samsung Galaxy from different devices.<br><br>Quick Share<br>Sharing files is a breeze with Quick Share. Its fast, easy, and secure.<br><br>One UI<br>One UI 6 lets you run things effortlessly just the way you like it. Its all about personalizing your everyday experiences.',100,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/1a/01/1a0180faaff44bdb98a1aa1e681db521/300x137/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/1a\\/01\\/1a0180faaff44bdb98a1aa1e681db521\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/14\\/f9\\/14f990f30774bf7c03076e8d12035bf4\\/1472x1831\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e6\\/e7\\/e6e7dca4f55f83d1a32754c769f4477f\\/884x1855\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/f4\\/e7\\/f4e791caa06702b961d719162c0721b0\\/979x1830\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/90\\/28\\/9028801257fdb16178f8b5aebe99ffd4\\/884x1855\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/af\\/ca\\/afcafd9fec7006f3fea4eaed4b8a8459\\/883x1856\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/54\\/4d\\/544d2ee57110b2c05512c817a8f50257\\/979x1830\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcd