even in dimly lit areas. Use Nightography to ensure every photo shines with detail, thanks to ProVisual Engine.<br><br><b>The most powerful camera on a Galaxy Z Flip, now with AI</b><br>The upgraded 50MP wide rear camera processes your pics through the ProVisual Engine to capture stunning scenes and richer portraits.<br><br><b>FlexCam. Capture your best angle</b><br>FlexCam uses Auto Zoom to either zoom in or out on subjects, and provides a preview on the FlexWindow for a hands-free selfie experience.<br><br><b>Rear cam portraits hit different</b><br>Use the FlexWindow to give your subjects a preview as you take their photo in 50 megapixels. Then, snap a pic to capture bright and detailed portraits even when backlit.<br><br><b>PHOTO ASSIST</b><br><b>Effortless editing. Courtesy of Galaxy AI</b><br><br><b>Generative Edit</b><br>Tap into your creativity with Generative Edit for Photo Assist to move, resize or delete whole objects from your photos and fill in the background where they used to be.<br><br><b>Instant Slow-mo</b><br>Put focus on key moments by applying slow motion to your videos and share or save it.<br><br><b>Live Effect</b><br>Add depth to give your pics all-new life.<br><br><b>Galaxy Z Flip\'s longest lasting battery</b><br>Meet our biggest Flip battery ever. Paired with SnapdragonÂ® 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy, you can talk, text or game to your heart\'s content â€” all day long.<br><br><b>First ever Vapour Chamber on a Galaxy Z Flip</b><br>Keep things cool, calm and running smoothly with a Vapour Chamber that dissipates heat quickly.',13,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/00/bc/00bc16ad9d04aeacb5bfce7a0219e2a9/1068x1335/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/00\\/bc\\/00bc16ad9d04aeacb5bfce7a0219e2a9\\/1068x1335\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d8\\/56\\/d856160d22d28dea780a3b129f0c3230\\/669x658\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/