ze with Quick Share. It\'s fast, easy, and secure.<br><br>Your privacy. Secured.<br>In Privacy and Security, quickly see which apps are accessing your information, then customise your settings. Plus, with Advanced Intelligence features, you can process data for AI services from your Galaxy device or on the cloud.',32,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/f7/81/f781ba90ae85451f78d53f83a75643a5/1023x1233/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/f7\\/81\\/f781ba90ae85451f78d53f83a75643a5\\/1023x1233\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/8c\\/c9\\/8cc998a5a52c59f0c467f163a11592a5\\/597x1267\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/8a\\/72\\/8a72f629b43e62ea76fc952c3b9150b3\\/596x1271\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/f0\\/f0\\/f0f0cacdf1bdfafab7ce46f36134603f\\/596x1271\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6f\\/d1\\/6fd1434624909f585aa402fdf6f9c1f2\\/651x1233\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d1\\/ce\\/d1cefa6059172e05bafa79ef4814eff9\\/650x1233\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/41\\/1d\\/411d55e0471a2cf2962a1d63338f065a\\/277x1294\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/9b\\/6f\\/9b6fd36301dc123adf999e3cd8bb57c1\\/597x1267\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/75\\/ca\\/75ca3b1939f6491fe490b97cff919ffa\\/402x1323\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a1\\/ba\\/a1bad9e677f635eca2cee9557372c26e\\/200x120\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":534.51,\"net\":641.41}',2,26,7294,22,'2025-08-20 14:16:43','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-