ence intelligent aesthetics. The Natural coastline design that\'s built for you.<br><br><b>Quad-Curved Floating Screen.</b><br>Elegant curves and smooth lines that offer a premium sensory experience.<br><br><b>Ultra-slim Design that Fits Your Hand.</b><br>At just 8.2mm, the ultra-thin, tactile design feels as good as it looks.<br><br><b>Artistry Meets Design.</b><br>Inspired by the form of Gaudi\'s \"Casa Mila\", where symmetry meet sensuous curves, crafting a new artistic vision.<br><br><b>The Portrait Master.</b><br>Beyond DSLR-level portraiture. Triple main cameras working together with AI deliver unparalleled images, capturing DSLR-quality light and shadows in every shot.<br><br><b>Triple 50MP Studio-level Portrait Camera.</b><br><br><b>HONOR AI Portrait Engine.</b><br>AI-driven photographic precision. AI learns facial features to capture all sides of you, differentiating options for portraits, backgrounds, and lighting for perfectly balanced images.<br><br><b>An Homage to Timeless Portrait Style.</b><br>With over 90 years of expertise, Studio Harcourt is the global specialist in the art of portraiture. Established in 1934 by Cosette Harcourt, it quickly gained immense success at a time when few people owned a camera.<br><br>Studio Harcourt\'s long and illustrious career is intertwined with cinema, the arts, and literature, epitomizing glamour, myth, stars, and its unique lighting style that sculpts faces and silhouettes with the use of light.<br><br><b>Multiple lighting effects allow you to artfully customize your compositions.</b><br><br><b>AI-enhanced Night Portrait Mode.</b><br>Night portraits to be proud of. Capture detailed portraits and backgrounds in low light and preserve true colours, thanks to a 1/1.3-inch main sensor and OIS, powered by robust AI photography algorithms.<br><br><b>Two modes, endless possibilities.</b><br><br><b>HDR Dual Style.</b><br>Freely switch between HDR modes to select portrait highlighting or silhouette atmosphere, and bring your portraits to life.<br><br><b>Achieve professional-level photos with your selfie camera.</b><br>A 50MP portrait selfie camera with an enhanced HONOR portrait algorithm brings yor selfies to life in vivid, high quality.<br><br><b>Capture it all, whatever the distance.</b><br>The 50MP telephoto camera which supports OIS features a digital zoom up to 50x.<br><br><b>Beyond what the eye can see.</b><br>A 12MP11 & 112Â° ultra-wide and macro camera means more can be captured and enjoyed.<br><br><b>More AI Features.</b><br>AI technology provides increased possibilities for artistic creation. Enjoy the limitless possibilities of AI from your phone.<br><br><b>Editing At Will, Bokeh As You Go.</b><br>The phone supports secondary editing of bokeh effects and easy focus switching, enhancing your<br>ability to craft compelling content.<br><br><b>Express yourself your way.</b><br>The AI learns facial features to enhance images in various lighting, like backlight or low light. It<br>also identifies facial hair and hairstyles, enabling you to craft a unique style.<br><br><b>Memories let you re-live and share life\'s most important moments.</b><br>Your photos and videos can be organized automatically into a timeline of highlights for you to<br>customize and share.<br><br><b>Instant Movie.</b><br>The AI technology has contributed to the \"Instant Movie\" short video feature, which optimizes the core<br>action capture algorithm, making video content more natural and the final product more cinematic!<br><br><b>Elegant Quad-curved Design,</b><br><b>All-round Protection of Your Eyes.</b><br><br><b>HONOR Eye Comfort Display.</b><br><br><b>3840Hz Risk-free Dimming Display.</b><br>The industry-leading 3840Hz ultra-high frequency PWM dimming is TÃœV Rheinland flicker-free<br>certified, achieving risk-free dimming level.<br><br><b>AI Circadian Night Display.</b><br>AI can intelligently recognize usage scenarios, realizing seamless color temperature for a good<br>night\'s sleep while promoting the secretion of melatonin in the human body.<br><br><b>Natural Tone 2.0.</b><br>Natural Tone 2.0 intelligently recognizes changes in environmental color temperature, sensing more<br>flexibly while adjusting the color temperature more sensitively.<br><br><b>Dynamic Dimming Display.</b><br>The Dynamic Dimming Display simulates the dynamic changes in natural light, promoting blood<br>circulation in the eyes through intelligent rhythmic light-changing technology that can alleviate<br>eye fatigue.<br><br><b>Hardware Level Low blue light.</b><br>Low blue light provides better protection for your eyes.<br><br><b>Dual Sensor Adaptive Dimming.</b><br>Dual sensors for environmental light recognize surrounding brightness more accurately.<br><br><b>HONOR C1+ RF Enhanced Chip.</b><br>Top quality hardware that supports more 5G coverage worldwide, while making overseas travel more convenient.<br><br><b>17%</b><br>The antenna transmission enhanced by up to<br><br><b>35%</b><br>The antenna reception enhanced by up to<br><br><b>All-new Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 delivering high-powered performance.</b><br>With TSMC\'s flagship 4nm process technology and the same architecture with Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, the AI is unleashed at full-strength capacity. Industry-leading 4nm process technology.<br><br><b>Power Meets Endurance.</b><br><br><b>5200mAh Silicon-carbon Battery.</b><br>HONOR Silicon-carbon Battery can reach up to 5200mAh for worry-free, all-day power, anytime and anywhere.<br><br><b>Experience True Freedom with</b><br><b>Instant Super Charging.</b><br><br><b>100W Wired HONOR SuperCharge</b><br>The charging rate of HONOR\'s Silicon-carbon battery has reached 100W for the first time in the industry.<br><br><b>All-range Cooling System 2.0 Always Powerful and Cool</b><br><b>Under Pressure.</b><br>The All-range Cooling System 2.0 adopts a super-large stainless steel biomimetic VC, 5564mm2, with a total heat dissipation area of 36881mm2, offers industry-leading, ultra-high thermal conductivity performance. This marks a new chapter in size, with 0.3mm in thickness.<br><br><b>GPU Turbo X</b><br><br><b>Low touch delay</b><br>Extremely fast response, immediate operation at a touch.<br><br><b>Super PC image quality</b><br>AI super rendering allows you to always enjoy PC-quality images.<br><br><b>Virtual display technology</b><br>Provide modes with higher frame rates.<br><br><b>Dual Stereo Speakers,</b><br><br><b>Unparalleled Sound Richness.</b><br>Dual stereo speakers let you enjoy immersive sound effects with a maximum volume of up to 200%,<br>while a sleep-aid volume that adapts to various scenarios, offering an immersive experience and a feast for the ears.<br><br><b>Headphone Spatial Audio Immerse Yourself in Sound.</b><br>HONOR Histen spatial audio brings sound effects to life.<br>Put on your headphones and enter a world of music.',47,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/df/0c/df0c3dda5cf527a4226b36e80be1c5f0/408x462/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/df\\/0c\\/df0c3dda5cf527a4226b36e80be1c5f0\\/408x462\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/99\\/19\\/9919110625d8b3645f940ab7f1cafc68\\/259x457\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7c\\/f1\\/7cf135479a9a5a525c7fe380a23d945c\\/205x447\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/05\\/fc\\/05fc3b0b570f753f8deec40a455b8a83\\/208x460\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/2d\\/34\\/2d34ec9031d79d41ae77fccb978bcb52\\/480x217\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e6\\/a2\\/e6a2c5a23774354f8b32702e181e566a\\/251x459\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/06\\/b3\\/06b3f6e2e1af857425a05c9ee4d39ebe\\/493x263\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1