wide</b><br>0.5x zoom for sceneries and rear camera selfies.<br><br><b>AI Capture Fusion</b><br>The main camera adds max detail to zoom shots.<br><br><b>The peace-and-quiet button</b><br>We canâ€™t turn off all the noise in your life. But Detox Mode can help with some of it.<br><br>Turn it on to block social app notifications. Theyâ€™ll wait for you until you turn the mode off.<br><br><b>Balance Interface. The peaceful middle-ground.</b><br><br><b>Itâ€™s the Android OS you know, but with a touch more zen.</b><br>Weâ€™ve moved a few things around to make them easier to find, and it sounds more chill with alarm clock sounds, notification sounds and ringtones that wonâ€™t have you jumping out of your skin.<br><br><b>Our team of writers did entire paragraphs on how HMD Skyline looks. But, honestly, we think the pictures speak for themselves.</b><br><br><b>The end of cracked screens ruining your day</b><br>Most of us know the feeling of dropping a phone and cracking the screen. It sucks, quite frankly.<br><br>But with HMD Skyline, itâ€™s not that big of a deal. Itâ€™s got Gen2 repairability, meaning we took something that was easy and made it even easier. Pop off the back cover and youâ€™re in. Then removing the screws and replacing the screen in a breeze.',23,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/1a/01/1a0180faaff44bdb98a1aa1e681db521/300x137/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/1a\\/01\\/1a0180faaff44bdb98a1aa1e681db521\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7a\\/61\\/7a61873fed3bcdb4298036046bfa92ba\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b4\\/62\\/b462e837e5590795e685cc5d70fb054e\\/786x786\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6d\\/3d\\/6d3d1ad935c74e700f61284fc066d84c\\/786x786\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/image