rn it on to block social app notifications. Theyâ€™ll wait for you until you turn the mode off.<br><br><b>Balance Interface. The peaceful middle-ground.</b><br><br><b>Itâ€™s the Android OS you know, but with a touch more zen.</b><br>Weâ€™ve moved a few things around to make them easier to find, and it sounds more chill with alarm clock sounds, notification sounds and ringtones that wonâ€™t have you jumping out of your skin.<br><br><b>Our team of writers did entire paragraphs on how HMD Skyline looks. But, honestly, we think the pictures speak for themselves.</b><br><br><b>The end of cracked screens ruining your day</b><br>Most of us know the feeling of dropping a phone and cracking the screen. It sucks, quite frankly.<br><br>But with HMD Skyline, itâ€™s not that big of a deal. Itâ€™s got Gen2 repairability, meaning we took something that was easy and made it even easier. Pop off the back cover and youâ€™re in. Then removing the screws and replacing the screen in a breeze.',146,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/1a/01/1a0180faaff44bdb98a1aa1e681db521/300x137/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/1a\\/01\\/1a0180faaff44bdb98a1aa1e681db521\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/80\\/cb\\/80cbb6e276aa24bda43b5949fea1c610\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/af\\/d0\\/afd070cc1f3b216f1d31c0fc025c113d\\/786x786\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/65\\/98\\/65988577b26d8b6cc5e5522c217d5c16\\/786x786\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/23\\/3f\\/233fa566c3a3e2dc0b469ab5f0a6208e\\/786x786\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7a\\/d0\\/7ad0669c7c2df2b6cb5fac6328c5aeee\\/786x786\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/i