 Super Fast Charging, it\'s back in action quickly.<br><br>Built to keep your passwords safe<br>Samsung Knox Vault is like a safe within a safe, physically isolating PINS, passwords and other private info so hackers cant gain access.<br><br>Crisp colours and details come alive on a 6.7\" display<br>â€Ž<br>â€Ž<br><br>Smart Switch<br>Easily transfer data to your new Samsung Galaxy from different devices.<br><br>Quick Share<br>Sharing files is a breeze with Quick Share. Its fast, easy, and secure.<br><br>One UI<br>One UI 6.1 lets you run things effortlessly just how you like it. Its all about personalising your everyday experiences.',1,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/04/7a/047a9308f2dd4a264c46c9c4f63fc745/990x1241/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/04\\/7a\\/047a9308f2dd4a264c46c9c4f63fc745\\/990x1241\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/4d\\/fa\\/4dfad8fd679081b105b22df5a9b263a3\\/591x1255\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/f3\\/bc\\/f3bcc8d62b3ab853c8fcb64c60e20475\\/591x1255\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/8a\\/68\\/8a68a666a1ef831c961327a7f35bbd29\\/350x1276\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/1f\\/9d\\/1f9dd551cbd1d1b2549408d169439dee\\/655x1241\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/2d\\/07\\/2d07a10505a208977dc39ccdb832f0f8\\/653x1241\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a4\\/72\\/a4720fce310c98d636e774de3a930fad\\/591x1255\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/52\\/e5\\/52e592e5a0dc43c44c9a0c26b18d98c9\\/397x1274\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/15\\/7a\\/157a52f65415b630cd969168