laxy S24 FE in stylish colours, with a slimmer bezel display. The rounded form ensures a comfortable grip, while the clean, flat design enhances your viewing pleasure.<br><br>Colourfully crafted for you<br>Explore the Galaxy S24 FE that matches your style, featuring a sleek, modern design and vibrant colours.<br><br>Built for durability<br>With CorningÂ® GorillaÂ® Glass VictusÂ®+ shielding the front and back, the phone is built to last. Plus, it comes with an IP68 rating for dust and water resistance.<br><br>Resize it, retouch it with Photo Assist<br>Use Photo Assist to easily resize, move, and remove unwanted objects in your photos. Transform everyday images into stunning works of art with our AI-powered editing tool.<br><br>Imagine it. Sketch it. See it with Sketch to Image<br>Draw from scratch or on any photo. Use AI to transform that sketch into an image.<br><br>Meet the most powerful camera ever in the Galaxy FE series<br>The ProVisual Engine is a comprehensive suite of AI-powered tools that enhances photos and videos with sharp details and rich textures, expanding the possibilities beyond just snapping a picture.<br><br>Stunning low-light portraits with Galaxy\'s ProVisual Engine<br>Bring out vivid moments in dark settings. The AI-powered camera ensures your subject stays bright and clear even in low-light.<br><br>Get clear shots from afar with Optical Quality Zoom<br>Capture detailed shots from afar effortlessly. Powered by advanced NPU and GPU, Optical Quality Zoom allows you to capture detailed close-ups without compromising quality. Bring your distant subjects into clear view with ease.<br><br>Light up your photos with Super HDR<br>Capture stunning photos with Super HDR, enhancing colours and scenes. Enjoy enriched colour expression and share your best shots directly to your social media, with Super HDR making bright areas even brighter.<br><br>Selfies become art with Portrait Studio<br>Let AI ignite your imagination with Portrait Studio. Self-portraits instantly turn into incredible works of art.<br><br>Hyper-realistic gaming experience<br>Meet the Galaxy S24 FE, now with the enhanced AP performance for smoother multitasking. Enjoy the cutting-edge Samsung Exynos 2400e for an incredibly captivating and realistic gaming experience.<br><br>Dive into an immersive viewing experience<br>Immerse yourself in captivating content with the enhanced Dynamic AMOLED 2X display, now brighter and more colourful than ever. Enjoy a larger screen and slimmer bezels, elevating your viewing experience to the next level.<br><br>A battery that works harder so you can play longer<br>Enjoy extended playtime, powered by a larger 4,700mAh typical battery. Perfectly optimised for video streaming, it\'s your ultimate companion for uninterrupted entertainment.<br><br>Resize it and retouch it with Photo Assist<br>â€Ž<br>â€Ž<br><br>Choose your colour and make it yours<br>â€Ž<br>â€Ž<br><br>Circle to Search<br>Search effortlessly with a simple circle gesture on your phone. Instantly find what you need, whether it\'s text or images.<br><br>Live Translate<br>Get real-time voice translation on various apps when you make a call.<br><br>Interpreter<br>Lost in translation? Galaxy S24 FE is your passport to communication - working as your personal interpreter.<br><br>Browsing Assist<br>â€Ž<br>Found a website that you need to understand quickly? AI summarises entire websites instantly.<br><br>Smart Switch<br>Easily transfer data to your S24 FE from different devices.<br><br>Quick Share<br>Sharing files is a breeze with Quick Share. It\'s fast, easy, and secure.<br><br>Your privacy. Secured.<br>In Privacy and Security, quickly see which apps are accessing your information, then customise your settings. Plus, with Advanced Intelligence features, you can process data for AI services from your Galaxy device or on the cloud.',36,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/8d/d4/8dd4f4e46f5c20416e9a293a0754b08a/1023x1233/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/8d\\/d4\\/8dd4f4e46f5c20416e9a293a0754b08a\\/1023x1233\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/69\\/f2\\/69f2345ef4e7a208694f3587001b015f\\/1920x1280\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e1\\/0d\\/e10d5a25e841cc02e5ab7056ee0ffbff\\/1920x1280\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7b\\/f7\\/7bf7888b6cb51c10d81e8e180f580d03\\/1920x1280\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/20\\/5b\\/205b00f4266e64ee64ed5206e75f65da\\/650x1233\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/17\\/48\\/1748b0d56b601fff03d2da811fac0adf\\/596x1271\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/86\\/5c\\/865c3f86acf6aa5fd87aab61a7e8b409\\/597x1267\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/5c\\/4f\\/5c4fb376faa04a227db47d93ce4f3533\\/597x1267\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/8f\\/8a\\/8f8a57ed8c7ab68d1b8d68f9c8f7a116\\/651x1233\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a1\\/ba\\/a1bad9e677f635eca2cee9557372c26e\\/200x120\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":434.65,\"net\":521.58}',2,26,7294,22,'2025-08-20 14:16:50','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:05:27','2025-09-02 14:05:27'),(21560,'CPH2637-512GB','CPH2637-512GB','oppo-reno-12-fs-5g-169-cm-667-dual-sim-android-14-usb-type-c-12-gb-512-gb-5000-mah-green-6gb-and-more-4-and-more-android-14-android-5g-triple-camera-dual-sim-256gb-and-more-bar-green-reno-cph2637-512gb','OPPO Reno 12 FS 5G 16.9 cm (6.67\") Dual SIM Android 14 USB Type-C 12 GB 512 GB 5000 mAh Green','<b>Make \"So So\" Snaps Sensational<br></b>Remove passing strangers and delete unwanted objects with ease. Upgraded to now support one-tap selection for seamless photo repairs. Your magic memories, made into ideal images in an instant.<br><br><b>More Fun with Your Faves<br></b>Quickly cut out people and pets from photos then add emojis, stickers, fun backgrounds and more, all without leaving the app. Your socials look slicker in seconds!<br><br><b>Bring Your Dreams to Life<br></b>Whether it\'s a perfect solo selfie or great group shot, AI Studio lets you create many artistic holiday and fashion themed portraits from a single photo to easily share with friends or on your socials.<br><br><b>Stay Close with Better Connectivity<br></b>Enjoy a smooth, seamless, and steady connection with faster sharing, and more precise navigation, not matter what the network conditions, thanks to 360-Degree Surrounding Antenna Design.<br><br><b>No Signal? No Problem.<br></b>Make voice calls even when there\'s no mobile signal. Make the previously impossible happen, as our exclusive technology boosts Bluetooth power, so you can still reach out to those nearby.<br><br><b>Choose Flagship Level Fashion<br></b>Classic beauty and understated, inclusive elegance are the order of the day with this stylish flagship-inspired Cosmos Ring Design. Bring those luxury watch feels to your phone.<br><br><b>Hello Halo<br></b>Stylish lighting just levelled up. The enchanting Halo Light in your camera module can be single or multi-colour and the lighting effects are diverse to match your music, calls, charging, notifications, and more.<br><br>This classically elegant olive tone glitters with flowing light and shadow effects, delivering iconic fashion tones and subtle, shimmering sophistication.<br><br><b>Slim, Light and <br>Heaven to Hold</b><br><br>Carefully crafted to be completely comfortable to hold, this phone is also slender and feather light. Everything you\'d expect from a premium feel phone.<br><br><b>Smooth, Bright,<br>and Low Blue Light</b><br><br>Enjoy a dazzling display that\'s easy on your eyes. Ultra-smooth running, ultra-bright, with inbuilt eye care, this screen is as intelligent as it is immersive.<br><br><b>Bedtime Mode<br></b>Sleep deeper when you enable Bedtime Mode. The screen colour subtly adapts; it presents a more comfortable viewing experience during end-of-day use, allowing you to fall asleep naturally and easily.<br><br><b>Rainy Days Won\'t<br>Get You Down</b><br>Keep that sensitive responsiveness, even when your hands or screen are wet. And the phone\'s structure offers IP64 water and dust resistance5, so it\'ll keep working, whatever the weather.<br><br><b>Portrait\'s New Golden Era<br></b>Capture naked-eye realism with the subject in crisp contrast to artistic blurred background, ensuring a more layered and sophisticated portrait. Naturally restore your looks without distortion.<br><br><b>Discover the Details, Capture the Excitement<br></b>Whether your subject is moving or still, you\'re shooting fast or slow, the Ultra-Clear Main Camera allows you to capture perfect details in total clarity anytime, anywhere.<br><br><b>Wider Angle,<br>Wider Smiles</b><br>Take gorgeous selfies, with the option of a wider angle to take in more of your background, so you can share your experiences as well as your smiles.<br><br><b>Dual View,<br>Double the Fun</b><br>Discover a fun way of creating scroll-stopping video content. Shoot from the front and rear cameras at the same time then videos are automatically combined into a single clip. No editing required!<br><br><b>Exceptional Energy Efficiency<br></b>Get better performance and increased energy efficiency, leading to smoother operation and serious staying power from each charge, with our new flagship platform with 6nm process.',4,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/67/46/6746f21a2eebc95d6ea87ead87e4c731/2000x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/67\\/46\\/6746f21a2eebc95d6ea87ead87e4c731\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/16\\/0d\\/160d37ac5c9e427828d8b1baa5b77121\\/200x70\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/34\\/18\\/34185009ac133d8698ab66bbbe26d9c7\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":218.36,\"net\":262.03}',2,276,12829,22,'2025-08-20 14:17:22','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:05:48','2025-09-02 14:05:48'),(21571,'77-97828','77-97828','otterbox-react-series-folio-for-magsafe-for-iphone-15-black-transparent-folio-case-apple-77-97828','OtterBox React Folio for MagSafe Series for Apple iPhone 16e/15/14/13, transparent/black - No Retail Packaging','Slim profile and resilient, React Series Folio protects your phone from drops and scrapes and simplifies your life. The folio cover with a magnetic closure protects your screen and helps to protect your privacy by blocking the view of wandering eyes. Its interior card slot holds essentials like ID, cards or even some cash. Its solid, one-piece chassis is precision-fit and its soft-touch edges provide a sure grip. Built-in magnets let you snap to MagSafe accessories, opening new ways to use your phone. Plus, the case installs fast, and it slides in and out of pockets seamlessly. Wrap your phone in the trusted protection of React Series Folio for MagSafe.',2,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/cb/a8/cba8b4416eb2432455acc2b6381b8410/1137x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/cb\\/a8\\/cba8b4416eb2432455acc2b6381b8410\\/1137x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e6\\/8c\\/e68c2c4beb819128a935c5b2e29a3039\\/1510x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c6\\/ca\\/c6cad2e2fb03c37ad9ec92917c8e7b83\\/1362x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/9f\\/2d\\/9f2df3653faf84a