terprise-secure, and tested-tough device that can dock with your screens and keyboards when you need to work big.<br><br><b>A revolution in mobility</b><br>Work in ways youâ€™ve never been able to before. For the first time, the HP Elite x3 puts the power of a PC in the palm of your hand, with a revolutionary high-performance processor, Windows 10 Mobile, and access to your corporate apps with HP Workspace.<br><br><b>Truly seamless</b><br>The HP Elite x3 is HPâ€™s first built-for-business mobile device to deliver seamless phablet, laptop and desktop business productivity in a single device. Effortlessly switch between screens when you dock to a large display with Windows Continuum.<br><br><b>Access your corporate apps on the go</b><br>Designed by HP to enable a new level of business mobility, HP Workspace lets you run your most frequently-used Windows and corporate applications virtually.<br><br><b>Built for business</b><br>The HP Elite x3 is ready for work with business-grade security, HP support, and durability thatâ€™s dust-and water-resistant6 and designed to pass MIL-STD 810G testing.',1,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/e8/5c/e85c09e541cc06257e7031e9dcfae6ee/1121x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e8\\/5c\\/e85c09e541cc06257e7031e9dcfae6ee\\/1121x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/62\\/67\\/62672d620bb0e28e527890cd96f0379c\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/3d\\/f1\\/3df17c3edd5caf49a7deac43b3501176\\/2000x1343\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b5\\/82\\/b5828373f632a9874c6b636f1094ed50\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/f4\\/a3\\/f4a332fac946cf72e80733ab632eaa2c\\/2000x1333\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co