.</b><br>Experience breathtaking sight and sound with the new moto g05. Watch your favourite programmes and films on a super-bright 6.67 display â€“ even outdoors in sunlight. And listen to sound all around thanks to powerful stereo speakers with bass boost. Capture beautifully sharp photos day or night with the 50MP(2) Quad Pixel camera system featuring AI-powered Portrait. Boost your speed with ultra-efficient performance and up to 12 GB of RAM available with RAM boost(5). With a vegan leather finish, water-repellent design(4) and CorningÂ® GorillaÂ® Glass 3, moto g05 gives you style that lasts. Rely on a long-lasting 5200 mAh battery and TurboPowerâ„¢ charging. And get tons of storage to hold your content and creations. moto g05 is stunning in every way.',138,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/08/ae/08aef840ebe319fbaa0516936352555d/2000x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/08\\/ae\\/08aef840ebe319fbaa0516936352555d\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ff\\/fb\\/fffb8d13781a5e00c6405e024b5ec5c9\\/178x200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/fa\\/e3\\/fae3316d761133cdc710680919d26e83\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/27\\/41\\/274128614eea2ee115d594ad14f4b871\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/b3\\/15\\/b31575a185cbbdde33d9cba0b6d32704\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ad\\/8f\\/ad8f42e6683cde1fc038f0f28d2e7868\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e7\\/c9\\/e7c908c4a7384ab34b8cd6d770298e0a\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/99\\/57\\/99577ba00ed074908f4617efb6972107\\/1964x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/23\\/1d\\/231df3645aa715273c2cc61afa2083a9\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/04\\/3a\\/043a4339bbad15c5eb8a2881d09e8071\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/46\\/b1\\/46b15b93ad28d5735c4277e99bfbaae7\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/3c\\/b3\\/3cb39f819f2fb5437dda884a2cad0249\\/200x120\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":67.02,\"net\":80.42}',2,105,13328,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:05','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:07:09','2025-09-02 14:07:09'),(22407,'SM-S936BDBGEUB','SM-S936BDBGEUB','samsung-galaxy-s25-17-cm-67-dual-sim-android-15-5g-usb-type-c-12-gb-512-gb-4900-mah-navy-5g-android-15-6gb-and-more-navy-dual-sim-256gb-and-more-bar-4-and-more-android-triple-camera-galaxy-s25-sm-s936bdbgeub','Samsung Galaxy S25+ 17 cm (6.7\") Dual SIM Android 15 5G USB Type-C 12 GB 512 GB 4900 mAh Navy','Simple. Impactful<br>Meet Galaxy S25 and S25+. A sleek, premium design wrapped in a strong aluminium frame with an immersive screen, sophisticated camera and now slimmed down for a more comfortable grip.<br><br>Looks sleek, built tough<br>Wrapped in a light aluminium frame, strengthened with CorningÂ® GorillaÂ® Glass VictusÂ® 2 display glass and rated with IP68 for moisture and dust resistance, Galaxy S25 and S25+ are designed to be taken virtually anywhere.<br><br>Personalised briefings for your day<br>Get personalised briefings throughout the day from the all-new Now Brief. Start your morning with a run-down of the day ahead, such as checking your latest Energy Score and reminders of a busy schedule. Then, recap on the day\'s events in the evening with daily activity insights.<br><br>A sound studio at your fingertips<br>Easily get rid of unwanted background noise from your videos and make them share-worthy with Audio Eraser. Fine-tune your audio by adjusting different types of sound including voices, music, wind and more.<br><br>The future of health, now made personal<br>Keep up with your health goals by tracking your Energy Score. Sync with Galaxy Watch or Ring and receive personalised insights and coaching such as an analysis of your sleep, activity and heart rate.<br><br>Personal data stays personal<br>The Personal Data Engine combines and processes your primary data and provides tailored suggestions. It encrypts this data and saves it on your device with Knox Vault, making it inaccessible to anyone else. You can even monitor the security of other Galaxy devices right from your Galaxy smartphone.<br><br>Unrivaled Nightography video. Less noise, more clarity<br>Now you can shoot in improved 10-bit HDR for a more stunning videography experience. Our advanced AP also delivers more precise noise removal meaning you won\'t have to worry about grainy night footage again.<br><br>Epic portraits, every single time<br>We see you. And so does our camera with enhanced Object-aware Engine that can adapt to various lighting environments. Capture skin tones and textures exactly as your eyes see them.<br><br>Filters just for you<br>Bring your pics to life with your own personalised filters. Galaxy AI will analyse your favourite photo and create a filter that captures the scene. Use it instantly or customise further to suit your mood with tweaks to the saturation, brightness and more.<br><br>Highlight reels made easy<br>Effortlessly create reels by collating your videos and simply hitting Auto Trim. AI will detect the key activity and trim them into highlight-ready clips that you can easily modify to your desired length.<br><br>The most powerful processor customised for Galaxy<br>Introducing our most powerful processor, customised for Galaxy. With improved real-time ray tracing and Vulkan optimisation, dive deep into the action with ultra-smooth gameplay thanks to SnapdragonÂ® 8 Elite Mobile Platform for Galaxy.<br><br>Clearer, more vivid viewing by ProScaler<br>Display image quality is even more stunning with our built-in ProScaler. AI-algorithm processing is used to deliver a viewing experience in high definition without having to adjust the display settings.<br><br>Unparalleled battery life<br>Thanks to our pioneering mDNIe technology built into our custom-made AP and software optimisation, Galaxy S25+\'s battery usage time is enhanced for you to enjoy hours of watching videos.<br><br>All new One UI 7, built for AI<br>Get access to your Now Brief alerts, music and more from the Now Bar. The new home screen is all yours with highly-customisable layouts and new widgets. Live notifications let you monitor on-going activities such as voice recordings on the Now Bar, status bar or at the top of your notification panel.',3,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/37/c7/37c7b01a5e3fc264377ffd34bc2c3549/2000x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/37\\/c7\\/37c7b01a5e3fc264377ffd34bc2c3549\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ff\\/fb\\/fffb8d13781a5e00c6405e024b5ec5c9\\/178x200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a1\\/ba\\/a1bad9e677f635eca2cee9557372c26e\\/200x120\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/47\\/3c\\/473ceed057b1018dfe01e0e8f2bb578e\\/178x200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":905.13,\"net\":1086.16}',2,26,13346,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:05','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:07:17','2025-09-02 14:07:17'),(22437,'SM-S938BZKHEUB','SM-S938BZKHEUB','samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-175-cm-69-dual-sim-android-15-5g-usb-type-c-12-gb-1-tb-5000-mah-black-titanium-quad-camera-android-15-6gb-and-more-5g-dual-sim-256gb-and-more-bar-android-4-and-more-