e to worry about grainy night footage again.<br><br>The sharpest details from Wide to Tele and even Ultra Wide<br>From Ultra Wide shots to our Telephoto camera, photos are clear and vivid at any angle. Our AI enhanced ProVisual Engine then improves colour and details for next-level clarity.<br><br>The most powerful processor customised for Galaxy<br>Introducing our most powerful processor, customised for Galaxy. With improved real-time ray tracing and Vulkan optimisation, dive deep into the action with ultra-smooth gameplay thanks to SnapdragonÂ® 8 Elite Mobile Platform for Galaxy.<br><br>Clearer, more vivid viewing by ProScaler<br>ProScaler enhances resolution by using advanced AI-algorithm processing to deliver a viewing experience in high definition without having to adjust the display settings.<br><br>Unparalleled battery life<br>Our pioneering mDNIe technology has been built into our custom-made AP, and with software optimisation, battery usage time is enhanced so you can enjoy hours of watching videos.<br><br>All new One UI 7, built for AI<br>Get access to your Now Brief alerts, music and more from the Now Bar. The new home screen is all yours with highly-customisable layouts and new widgets. Live notifications let you monitor on-going activities such as voice recordings on the Now Bar, status bar or at the top of your notification panel.',1,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/ff/fb/fffb8d13781a5e00c6405e024b5ec5c9/178x200/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ff\\/fb\\/fffb8d13781a5e00c6405e024b5ec5c9\\/178x200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c9\\/bd\\/c9bdf6660050dbca2dca20b2d39e623c\\/1020x1938\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/8e\\/72\\/8e7217043018ad2cb7086e039c6e3dca\\/936x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a1\\/ba\\/a1bad9e677f635eca2cee