ze it, retouch it with Photo Assist<br>Use Photo Assist to easily resize, move, and remove unwanted objects in your photos. Transform everyday images into stunning works of art with our AI-powered editing tool.<br><br>Imagine it. Sketch it. See it with Sketch to Image<br>Draw from scratch or on any photo. Use AI to transform that sketch into an image.<br><br>Meet the most powerful camera ever in the Galaxy FE series<br>The ProVisual Engine is a comprehensive suite of AI-powered tools that enhances photos and videos with sharp details and rich textures, expanding the possibilities beyond just snapping a picture.<br><br>Stunning low-light portraits with Galaxy\'s ProVisual Engine<br>Bring out vivid moments in dark settings. The AI-powered camera ensures your subject stays bright and clear even in low-light.<br><br>Get clear shots from afar with Optical Quality Zoom<br>Capture detailed shots from afar effortlessly. Powered by advanced NPU and GPU, Optical Quality Zoom allows you to capture detailed close-ups without compromising quality. Bring your distant subjects into clear view with ease.<br><br>Light up your photos with Super HDR<br>Capture stunning photos with Super HDR, enhancing colours and scenes. Enjoy enriched colour expression and share your best shots directly to your social media, with Super HDR making bright areas even brighter.<br><br>Create cinematic moments with Instant Slow-mo<br>Turn any video into slow-motion with Instant Slow-mo, even those not originally shot that way in your gallery or downloads. Simply touch and hold to apply the effect instantly, then share or save the clip with ease.<br><br>Selfies become art with Portrait Studio<br>Let AI ignite your imagination with Portrait Studio. Self-portraits instantly turn into incredible works of art.<br><br>Hyper-realistic gaming experience<br>Meet the Galaxy S24 FE, now with the enhanced AP performance for smoother multitasking. Enjoy the cutting-edge Samsung Exynos 2400e for an incredibly captivating and realistic gaming experience.<br><br>Dive into an immersive viewing experience<br>Immerse yourself in captivating content with the enhanced Dynamic AMOLED 2X display, now brighter and more colourful than ever. Enjoy a larger screen and slimmer bezels, elevating your viewing experience to the next level.<br><br>A battery that works harder so you can play longer<br>Enjoy extended playtime, powered by a larger 4,700mAh typical battery. Perfectly optimised for video streaming, it\'s your ultimate companion for uninterrupted entertainment.<br><br>Resize it and retouch it with Photo Assist<br>â€Ž<br>â€Ž<br><br>Choose your colour and make it yours<br>â€Ž<br>â€Ž<br><br>Circle to Search<br>Search effortlessly with a simple circle gesture on your phone. Instantly find what you need, whether it\'s text or images.<br><br>Live Translate<br>Get real-time voice translation on various apps when you make a call.<br><br>Interpreter<br>Lost in translation? Galaxy S24 FE is your passport to communication - working as your personal interpreter.<br><br>Browsing Assist<br>â€Ž<br>Found a website that you need to understand quickly? AI summarises entire websites instantly.<br><br>Smart Switch<br>Easily transfer data to your S24 FE from different devices.<br><br>Quick Share<br>Sharing files is a breeze with Quick Share. It\'s fast, easy, and secure.<br><br>Your privacy. Secured.<br>In Privacy and Security, quickly see which apps are accessing your information, then customise your settings. Plus, with Advanced Intelligence features, you can process data for AI services from your Galaxy device or on the cloud.',3,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/ff/0c/ff0c0a1f687c8ea40e444c3ac6d8c0a9/1310x1625/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ff\\/0c\\/ff0c0a1f687c8ea40e444c3ac6d8c0a9\\/1310x1625\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a1\\/ba\\/a1bad9e677f635eca2cee9557372c26e\\/200x120\\/webp\\/resize?