ourite content with the vibrant colours and lifelike details of the FHD+ Super AMOLED display.<br><br><b>Stay fresh with a slim design</b><br>Bring a burst of energy to your look with the slim and lively design of Galaxy A16. Available in Black, Light Green and Grey.<br><br><b>Turn everyday moments into frame-worthy photos</b><br>Capture detailed shots with Galaxy A16\'s advanced cameras. Use the 50MP Main Camera to snap memories and the 13MP Front Camera to take clear selfies, highlighting key details in your photos.<br><br><b>Smooth riding with powerful performance</b><br>Whether you\'re gaming heavy or powering through work, the Octa-core processor is capable of keeping your tasks running smoothly.<br><br><b>Reliable protection for daily life</b><br>Now, thanks to IP54 protection, you can go about your day with peace of mind. This added durability means it can handle the little surprises of your day, so you can stay focused on what\'s important.<br><br><b>Built to last with 6x OS upgrades</b><br>Offered with up to 6 generations of OS upgrades and 6 years of security maintenance, your Galaxy A16 stays up-to-date for longer.<br><br><b>Power up fast, stay powered long</b><br>Enjoy what you love without worrying about battery lifeâ€”the 5,000mAh battery keeps Galaxy A16 running strong on a single charge. And with Super Fast Charging, it\'s back in action quickly.<br><br><b>Built to keep your passwords safe</b><br>Samsung Knox Vault is like a safe within a safe, physically isolating PINS, passwords and other private info so hackers cant gain access.<br><br><b>Smart Switch</b><br>Easily transfer data to your new Samsung Galaxy from different devices.<br><br><b>Quick Share</b><br>Sharing files is a breeze with Quick Share. Its fast, easy, and secure.<br><br><b>One UI</b><br>One UI 6.1 lets you run things effortlessly just how you like it. Its all about personalising your everyday experiences.',72,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/c1/cd/c1cd491675ba76eff71bb76b730aec6e/991x1