><br><br><b>Titanium.</b><br><b>So strong. So light. So Pro.</b><br><br><b>iPhone 15 Pro Max has the longest optical zoom in iPhone ever. Far out.</b><br><br><b>All-new Action button.</b><br><b>What will yours do?</b><br><br>The first iPhone with an aerospaceâ€‘grade titanium design. A17 Pro, a game-changing chip. A customizable Action button. The most powerful iPhone camera system. And USBâ€‘C with USB 3 for superfast transfer speeds.',3,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/d1/a1/d1a19cf08e79fd688f5535d1bf103962/2000x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d1\\/a1\\/d1a19cf08e79fd688f5535d1bf103962\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/58\\/5f\\/585f512fc37e422641b6f12c15aa1328\\/300x137\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/77\\/c0\\/77c0b6580ff0e68dd65e8d0c380295f6\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c0\\/a3\\/c0a37e05b5f38e17daec97481e58383d\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/d9\\/5c\\/d95cda48c3a5408a447a8b95d31fc634\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/95\\/ec\\/95ec076892a8412c887d083c572f236f\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/5d\\/83\\/5d83d9420aa9d86bd7fdda93bd288770\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/ff\\/fb\\/fffb8d13781a5e00c6405e024b5ec5c9\\/178x200\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":1098.9,\"net\":1318.68}',2,44,6339,22,'2025-08-20 14:15:34','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:21:29','2025-09-02 14:21:29'),(29960,'SM-A155FZBDEUB','SM-A155FZBDEUB','samsung-galaxy-sm-a155f-165-cm-65-hybrid-dual-sim-android-14-4g-usb-type-c-4-gb-128-gb-5000-mah-blue-128gb-to-256gb-blue-android-14-bar-4-and-more-4gb-to-6gb-android-4g-triple-camera-hybrid-dual-sim-galaxy-a15-sm-a155fzbdeub','Samsung Galaxy SM-A155F 16.5 cm (6.5\") Hybrid Dual SIM Android 14 4G USB Type-C 4 GB 128 GB 5000 mAh Blue','Super vivid and bright display<br>The Galaxy A15\'s 6.5-inch Super AMOLED display boasts vibrant clarity even in direct sunlight with Vision Booster, smooth-scrolling with improved 90Hz refresh rate, enhanced brightness up to 800 nits, and all-day comfort with reduced blue light thanks to Eye Comfort Shield.<br><br>Balanced simplicity<br>Designed to fulfill. The Galaxy A15 showcases its refined aesthetics through an intuitive frame, glossy back cover and tidy camera layout. Available in Blue Black, Blue and Yellow.<br><br>Pick your lens. Find your angle.<br>Go on and express your world. The Galaxy A15 boasts a 50MP Main camera for your masterpiece, 5MP Ultra Wide and 2MP Macro cameras for landscapes and close-ups, and a 13MP Front camera for profile-worthy selfies.<br><br>Get it done with boosted performance<br>Your day runs smoother with an octa-core processor for powerful performance while spacious memory and storage options keep your data and contents ready at hand.<br><br>Stay in the zone with a 2-day battery<br>More time to get productive with a 5,000mAh (typical) battery that lasts for 2 days and recharges rapidly with Super Fast Charging.<br><br>Trust in Samsung Knox Vault<br>Certified EAL5+, Samsung Knox Vault is designed to safeguard your sensitive data, such as PINs, passwords and patterns, in a separate tamper-resistant storage for protection against software and hardware threats involving voltage, glitches, high temperature and laser.<br><br>Keep up with the latest for longer<br>Offered with up to 4 generations of OS upgrades and 5 years of security maintenance, your Galaxy A15 stays up-to-date for longer.<br><br>Unlock with your fingerprint<br>Double-checked by the side fingerprint sensor, your security is designed to be accessible only by your fingerprint.<br><br>Smart Switch<br>Whether from another Galaxy, iOS or other Android device, the data you care about can now be brought over to your new Galaxy effortlessly.<br><br>Quick Share<br>Sharing your files, photos and documents just became quick and secure.<br><br>Connected Experience<br>Boost your productivity and creativity across Samsung Galaxy devices.',2,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/7c/34/7c347c4f5c574ad78bdccb8f88cbf421/1658x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/7c\\/34\\/7c347c4f5c574ad78bdccb8f88cbf421\\/1658x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/75\\/d2\\/75d2a19572dff31c85723d212302703e\\/1066x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6a\\/40\\/6a402b22f4a07ecbb438f34e77e05d20\\/298x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/4d\\/fd\\/4dfd03909ce4a7c6f067632daaf41be3\\/298x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/6d\\/72\\/6d725be0a3c1c81948ac6c21ee246a90\\/943x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e6\\/03\\/e6037d0937058f61ec9497d47b6ae7ad\\/944x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/34\\/f0\\/34f019dc7bd1235541cecb573e558702\\/944x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/80\\/8f\\/808f05d104c3102c31b29c196d4a88bf\\/943x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/23\\/b2\\/23b215c5b2178ac1f103eff8cae03451\\/1066x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":139.56,\"net\":167.47}',2,26,17488,22,'2025-08-20 14:15:51','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:21:43','2025-09-02 14:21:43'),(3023