he folio cover with a magnetic closure protects your screen and helps to protect your privacy by blocking the view of wandering eyes. Its interior card slot holds essentials like ID, cards or even some cash. Its solid, one-piece chassis is precision-fit and its soft-touch edges provide a sure grip. Built-in magnets let you snap to MagSafe accessories, opening new ways to use your phone. Plus, the case installs fast, and it slides in and out of pockets seamlessly. Wrap your phone in the trusted protection of React Series Folio for MagSafe.',2,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/cb/a8/cba8b4416eb2432455acc2b6381b8410/1137x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/cb\\/a8\\/cba8b4416eb2432455acc2b6381b8410\\/1137x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e6\\/8c\\/e68c2c4beb819128a935c5b2e29a3039\\/1510x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/c6\\/ca\\/c6cad2e2fb03c37ad9ec92917c8e7b83\\/1362x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/9f\\/2d\\/9f2df3653faf84a51e6fd518f203fd9f\\/2000x1849\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/09\\/c7\\/09c7553c8ca57f5c2ca77fbd47f7a53e\\/1425x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":14.29,\"net\":17.15}',2,33,5310,22,'2025-08-20 14:17:30','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:22:37','2025-09-02 14:22:37'),(30536,'SM-S937BZKDEUB','SM-S937BZKDEUB','samsung-galaxy-s25-edge-black-android-15-6gb-and-more-bar-4-and-more-dual-sim-android-5g-dual-camera-256gb-and-more-galaxy-sm-s937bzkdeub','Samsung Galaxy S25 Edge','<b>Crafted to be ultra sleek and premium</b><br>Innovation opens new possibilities. With engineering marvel and craftsmanship, the perfect balance is now a reality. Welcome to the Edge of premium slim. Galaxy S25 Edge.<br><br><b>Engineered to hold a 200 MP camera</b><br>Powered by AI, the next-gen ProVisual Engine gets an extra boost from Galaxy S25 Edge\'s high-speed processor. Bring your creative vision to life from capture to edits, with Galaxy S25 Edge\'s advanced camera system and pro-grade tools.<br><br><b>The sharpest details with 200 megapixels</b><br>Galaxy S25 Edge\'s advanced camera system fits our finest 200 MP into the rear camera, with the AI-enhanced ProVisual Engine improving colour and details for next-level clarity, day or night. You can also zoom in and capture enhanced details with the AI Zoom solution.<br><br><b>A sound studio at your fingertips</b><br>Filter out unwanted background noise from your videos and make them share-worthy with Audio Eraser. Galaxy AI fine-tunes your audio by adjusting different types of sound including voices, music, wind and more.<br><br><b>The most powerful processor, customised for Galaxy</b><br>Introducing the most powerful processor, the SnapdragonÂ® 8 Elite Mobile Platform for Galaxy. It\'s the driving force behind fast processing and AI performance.<br><br><b>All-day battery fit for slim</b><br>With our pioneering mDNIe technology built into our custom-made AP and software optimisation, Galaxy S25 Edge\'s battery usage time lets you enjoy hours of watching videos.<br><br><b>Personalised briefings for your day</b><br>Get personalised briefings throughout the day from the all-new Now Brief. Start your morning with a run-down of the day ahead, such as checking your latest Energy Score and reminders of a busy schedule. Then, recap on the day\'s events in the evening with daily activity insights.<br><br><b>Personal data stays personal</b><br>The Personal Data Engine combines and processes your primary data and provides tailored suggestions. It encrypts this data and saves it on your device with Knox Vault, making it inaccessible to anyone else.<br><br><b>All new One UI 7, built for AI</b><br>Get access to your Now Brief alerts, music and more from the Now Bar. The new home screen is all yours with highly-customisable layouts and new widgets. Live notifications let you monitor on-going activities such as voice recordings on the Now Bar, status bar or at the top of your notification panel.',8.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":894.61,\"net\":1073.53}',2,26,13346,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:26','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:23:12','2025-09-02 14:23:12'),(30578,'SM-S937BZKGEUB','SM-S937BZKGEUB','samsung-galaxy-s25-edge-black-android-15-6gb-and-more-bar-4-and-more-android-5g-dual-camera-dual-sim-256gb-and-more-galaxy-sm-s937bzkgeub','Samsung Galaxy S25 Edge','<b>Crafted to be ultra sleek and premium</b><br>Innovation opens new possibilities. With engineering marvel and craftsmanship, the perfect balance is now a reality. Welcome to the Edge of premium slim. Galaxy S25 Edge.<br><br><b>Engineered to hold a 200 MP camera</b><br>Powered by AI, the next-gen ProVisual Engine gets an extra boost from Galaxy S25 Edge\'s high-speed processor. Bring your creative vision to life from capture to edits, with Galaxy S25 Edge\'s advanced camera system and pro-grade tools.<br><br><b>The sharpest details with 200 megapixels</b><br>Galaxy S25 Edge\'s advanced camera system fits our finest 200 MP into the rear camera, with the AI-enhanced ProVisual Engine improving colour and details for next-level clarity, day or night. You can also zoom in and capture enhanced details with the AI Zoom solution.<br><br><b>A sound studio at your fingertips</b><br>Filter out unwanted background noise from your videos and make them share-worthy with Audio Eraser. Galaxy AI fine-tunes your audio by adjusting different types of sound including voices, music, wind and more.<br><br><b>The most powerful processor, customised for Galaxy</b><br>Introducing the most powerful processor, the SnapdragonÂ® 8 Elite Mobile Platform for Galaxy. It\'s the driving force behind fast processing and AI performance.<br><br><b>All-day battery fit for slim</b><br>With our pioneering mDNIe technology built into our custom-made AP and software optimisation, Galaxy S25 Edge\'s battery usage time lets you enjoy hours of watching videos.<br><br><b>Personalised briefings for your day</b><br>Get personalised briefings throughout the day from the all-new Now Brief. Start your morning with a run-down of the day ahead, such as checking your latest Energy Score and reminders of a busy schedule. Then, recap on the day\'s events in the evening with daily activity insights.<br><br><b>Personal data stays personal</b><br>The Personal Data Engine combines and processes your primary data and provides tailored suggestions. It encrypts this data and saves it on your device with Knox Vault, making it inaccessible to anyone else.<br><br><b>All new One UI 7, built for AI</b><br>Get access to your Now Brief alerts, music and more from the Now Bar. The new home screen is all yours with highly-customisable layouts and new widgets. Live notifications let you monitor on-going activities such as voice recordings on the Now Bar, status bar or at the top of your notification panel.',2.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":987.49,\"net\":1184.99}',2,26,13346,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:26','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:23:18','2025-09-02 14:23:18'),(30589,'T517H-2ALCA112','T517H-2ALCA112','tcl-60-se-17-cm-67-dual-sim-android-15-4g-usb-type-c-8-gb-512-gb-5200-mah-black-black-android-15-6gb-and-more-bar-4-and-more-android-4g-dual-camera-dual-sim-256gb-and-more-60-t517h-2alca112','TCL 60 SE 17 cm (6.7\") Dual SIM Android 15 4G USB Type-C 8 GB 512 GB 5200 mAh Black',NULL,3.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":98.98,\"net\":118.78}',2,132,17851,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:26','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:23:20','2025-09-02 14:23:20'),(30626,'T517D-2ALCA112','T517D-2ALCA112','tcl-605-169-cm-667-dual-sim-android-15-4g-usb-type-c-4-gb-128-gb-5200-mah-black-black-android-15-4gb-to-6gb-bar-4-and-more-android-4g-dual-camera-dual-sim-128gb-to-256gb-t517d-2alca112','TCL 605 16.9 cm (6.67\") Dual SIM Android 15 4G USB Type-C 4 GB 128 GB 5200 mAh Black','<div class=ccs-ds-textMkt> <p>Experience the power and versatility of the TCL 605 smartphone. With a large 6.67-inch HD+ display, enjoy vibrant colors and an immersive viewing experience for your favorite content. The touch-sensitive screen features 90 Hz refresh rate and a hole-punch design, providing smooth interactions and maximizing screen space. Equipped with a MediaTek Helio G81 processor, this smartphone delivers solid performance whether for gaming, streaming, or multitasking. Its 4 GB of RAM supports effortless navigation, while an additional 4 GB of virtual RAM provides further enhancement when needed.</p> <p>Capture stunning photographs with the dual rear camera system, which includes a 50-megapixel main camera with features such as AI scene detection and a separate depth sensor for portrait effects. The 5-megapixel front camera includes group selfie and gesture capture options, allowing for creative photography. Additionally, with a long-lasting 5200 mAh battery, enjoy up to 2947 minutes of use per cycle, ensuring the device remains powered throughout the day. Dual-SIM capability, combined with extensive connectivity options including NFC and Bluetooth 5.1, makes this smartphone a choice for users needing reliable communication and entertainment on the go.</p> </div> <div class=ccs-ds-textFeatures> <h3>High-resolution display</h3> <p>The TCL 605 features a 6.67-inch diagonal display with a resolution of 1600 x 720 pixels, providing a vivid and engaging visual experience for media consumption and gaming.</p> <h3>Robust battery life</h3> <p>Equipped with a 5200 mAh battery, this smartphone offers endurance of up to 1000 cycles, allowing for extended use without frequent recharging.</p> <h3>Advanced camera technology</h3> <p>With a dual rear camera setup, including a 50-megapixel lens with AI capabilities, the TCL 605 captures high-quality images even in challenging lighting conditions.</p> <h3>Enhanced connectivity options</h3> <p>This smartphone supports multiple connectivity standards including NFC, Bluetooth 5.1, and 4G LTE, ensuring fast data transmission and convenient wireless interactions.</p> <h3>Durable design</h3> <p>Featuring an IP54 rating, the TCL 605 is splash and dust resistant, making it suitable for everyday use in various environments.</p> </div>',1474.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":65.73,\"net\":78.88}',2,132,17860,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:26','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:23:25','2025-09-02 14:23:25'),(30682,'SM-G766BZKDEEB','SM-G766BZKDEEB','samsung-galaxy-xcover7-pro-enterprise-edition-xcover7-pro-168-cm-66-dual-sim-android-15-5g-usb-type-c-6-gb-128-gb-4350-mah-black-black-5g-android-15-bar-4-and-more-single-camera-dual-sim-6gb-and-more-android-128gb-to-256gb-galaxy-xcover7-pro-enterprise-ed','Samsung Galaxy XCover7 Pro Enterprise Edition XCover7 Pro 16.8 cm (6.6\") Dual SIM Android 15 5G USB Type-C 6 GB 128 GB 4350 mAh Black','Built to be rugged<br>Galaxy XCover7 Pro features an IP68 rating for dust and water resistance, helping protect against spills, splashes and dusty environmentâ€”so you can keep going even when conditions aren\'t ideal.<br><br>Strong. Certified. Reliable<br>With CorningÂ® GorillaÂ® Glass Victus+ and MIL-STD-810H certification, Galaxy XCover7 Pro is designed to withstand extreme temperatures, drops, dust, and vibrationâ€”ready to keep up with the toughest of tasks.<br><br>Power through the workday uninterrupted<br>The long-lasting 4,350 mAh battery keeps you powered throughout your workday. When its time to recharge, use 15 W fast charging or swap in a replaceable battery to reduce downtime. For easy, continuous power, simply dock in a POGO charger.<br><br>Bright display with Vision Booster<br>Whether you\'re out in the field or on-site, Vision Booster keeps Galaxy XCover7 Pro\'s high-resolution display sharp and vivid. You\'ll have the clarity and confidence you need to stay focused, wherever the job takes you.<br><br>Smooth connection, smooth workflow<br>Spend more time working and less time waiting for connectivity. Galaxy XCover7 Pro offers fast and reliable 5G Sub6 and Wi-Fi 6E connectivity for high-speed data access.<br><br>Hear every word, even in loud environments<br>In mission-critical environments like emergency response or industrial sites, multiple nearby devices can cause disruptive audio feedback. Galaxy XCover7 Pros anti-feedback technology actively reduces interference, ensuring stable push-to-talk communication so teams can stay focused without interruption. Paired with tuned stereo speakers, the device delivers reliable, high-quality soundâ€”even in noisy work environments.<br><br>More power. More storage<br>Maximise your work efficiency with Galaxy XCover7 Pro and SnapdragonÂ® 7s Gen 3 processor and 6 GB of memory. Internal storage provides 128 GB for all your work files, photos and videos, and you can add up to 2 TB more with a microSD card.<br><br>Circle it to find what you need instantly<br>Instantly search anything you see on your Galaxy XCover7 Pro with Google. Circle, highlight, scribble or tap any image, video or text to search without switching apps. Quickly get the info you need then get right back to what you\'re doing.<br><br>Photo editing made simple with AI<br>Keep your business visuals clean and distraction-free with AI Object Eraser. Quickly remove unwanted elements and let AI fill in the background, saving time on edits and ensuring polished images for reports, presentations, and client materials.<br><br>Smart actions with AI Select<br>Save time on scheduling and data entry with AI Select. Simply circle key details like meeting times or deadlines on your screen, and AI instantly add them to your calendar. No manual input, no extra steps.<br><br>Your privacy secured with Knox Vault<br>Safeguard your sensitive data with Samsung Knox Vault, which provides robust encryption and authentication for advanced security.',317.00,NULL,'[]','{\