oom letting you take photos ranging from breathtaking scenic mountains to tiny dewdrops</p> <p><strong>Power through your day.</strong><br>Rely on a robust power source that keeps you going for up to 2 days and charges quickly, ensuring you stay connected during busy schedules or travel.</p>',52.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":126.81,\"net\":152.17}',2,132,17851,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:26','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:23:37','2025-09-02 14:23:37'),(30725,'8897','8897','doro-aurora-a20-114-cm-45-dual-sim-android-14-4g-usb-type-c-4-gb-64-gb-3000-mah-graphite-64gb-to-128gb-graphite-android-14-1280-x-720-pixels-clamshell-4-and-more-4gb-to-6gb-single-camera-dual-sim-android-4g-8897','Doro Aurora A20 11.4 cm (4.5\") Dual SIM Android 14 4G USB Type-C 4 GB 64 GB 3000 mAh Graphite','Enjoy an easy to use smartphone with a folding backlit keypad, TeamViewer for getting remote support, and our Doro Secure Button for alerting relatives if you should ever need help. A simplified interface with helpful tips makes it easier to organise and understand your favourite apps. Other features include voice control with Google Assistant / Gemini and Doro ClearSound for clearer conversations in noisy environments.',11.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":167.38,\"net\":200.86}',2,98,17787,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:26','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:23:36','2025-09-02 14:23:36'),(30726,'8885','8885','doro-aurora-a10-114-cm-45-dual-sim-android-14-4g-usb-type-c-4-gb-64-gb-3000-mah-graphite-64gb-to-128gb-graphite-android-14-1280-x-720-pixels-bar-4-and-more-single-camera-dual-sim-4gb-to-6gb-android-4g-8885','Doro Aurora A10 11.4 cm (4.5\") Dual SIM Android 14 4G USB Type-C 4 GB 64 GB 3000 mAh Graphite','Enjoy a pocket-friendly, easy to use smartphone with tactile buttons, TeamViewer for getting remote support, and the Doro Secure Button for alerting relatives if you need help. A simplified interface with helpful tips makes it easier to organise and understand your favourite apps. Other fe