fer your data</b><br>Switch from any other phone in no time, with all your contacts, photos, and more.<br><br><b>Enjoy the Android experience</b><br>Get the most out of your phone with our Android tips and tricks.<br><br><b>Maximise your phoneâ€™s life</b><br>Extend the life of your phone with our extended warranty and Fairphone App.<br><br><br><br>',32.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":395.24,\"net\":474.29}',2,117,18062,22,'2025-08-20 14:18:57','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:24:37','2025-09-02 14:24:37'),(31120,'5109BVFR','5109BVFR','honor-x6c-168-cm-661-dual-sim-android-15-4g-usb-type-c-6-gb-128-gb-5300-mah-black-black-android-15-6gb-and-more-bar-1920-x-1080-pixels-4-and-more-dual-sim-android-4g-triple-camera-128gb-to-256gb-x-series-5109bvfr','Honor X6c 16.8 cm (6.61\") Dual SIM Android 15 4G USB Type-C 6 GB 128 GB 5300 mAh Black','<b>From Nature\'s Palette to Your Hand.</b><br><br><b>One-Click Access, AI at Your Service.</b><br>A physical side button lets you quickly launch commands and frequently used apps with<br>a single press<br><br><b>Smarter Features, Just A Click Away.</b><br>Long press the AI button to unlock smart visual features and get instant information.<br><br><b>Homework Assistance</b><br>Receive problem-solving guidance, answers, and key insights.<br><br><b>Search Objects</b><br>Identify various objects, like animals and plants, for access to related information.<br><br><b>Text Translation</b><br>Translate text in real-time with support for over 100 languages, wherever you are.<br><br><b>50MP Clarity, AI Perfects Every Shot.</b><br><br><b>50MP</b><br>Preserve every instant in stunning detail with a 50MP camera, delivering clarity day or night.<br><br><b>HONOR AI Eraser</b><br>Your Imperfect Moments, Perfected.<br><br><b>More Swipes, More Streams, More Battery.<br><br>Over 4 years. Performance that Lasts</b><br><br><b>At Full Charge Enjoy:</b><br>- 14.3 hours Online Short Video<br>- 63.7 hours Music Playback<br>- 25.5 hours Social Software<