r><b>Advanced Zoom and Portrait Features</b><br>Get up close with AI Super Zoom to capture details from any distance with up to 30X zoom delivering unmatched clarity. AI Portrait Snap captures motion in breath-taking clarity using AI Blur Calculation to ensure that every portrait stays naturally clear.<br><br><b>Smart AI Photo Editing Tools</b><br>Edit photos in just a tap with AI Editing. Bring static photos to life as animated videos with AI Image to Video. Magically expand photos beyond the frame with AI Outpainting. Say goodbye to window reflections and remove unwanted objects with AI Eraser. Cut and reposition objects in photos with AI Cut Out. Bring special moments back to life with AI Upscale that enhances photo resolution. Take perfect group shots with AI Face Tune that ensures everyone shows their best self.<br><br><b>Effortless Photo Sharing</b><br>Sharing photos is more fun with HONOR Connect. Seamlessly stitch your favourite photo collections with HD Moving Photo collage and share images instantly with friends on iPhone and Android using AI Connect.<br>Smarter Everyday Features<br>Discover the most intelligent Android HONOR AI experience powered by MagicOS 9.0 with Google Gemini, Google Lens, Circle to Search and Magic Portal. Learn, play and travel with premium smart features such as AI Translation, AI Writing Tools, AI Summary, AI Recorder, AI Minutes and AI Subtitles.<br><br><b>All-Day Battery Life</b><br>The ultra-large 5300mAh silicon-carbon AI Battery provides all-day power including 33 hours of voice calls, 26 hours of offline video viewing and 15 hours of video entertainment online. Built for longevity, an incredible 80% of battery health is maintained for at least 4 years and 1200 recharge cycles. The 66W Wired SuperCharge provides instant power and maximum freedom, charging to 44% in just 15 minutes.<br><br><b>Vivid AMOLED Display</b><br>Ultra-bright 6.55-inch AMOLED display with 5000nits HDR Peak Brightness presents every detail clearly, even 