ain color vibrancy and features a coating to protect the display against scratches and fingerprints<br/><br/>Installation<br/><br/>The included applicator frame ensures a quick, precise, and bubble-free installation directly onto the iPhone screen for a long-lasting fit. The tempered glass protector features a precise fit that does not interfere with the sensors around the display, front camera, or earpiece.<br/><br/>Blue Light Reduction<br/><br/>This Blue Light Reduction Privacy Shield reduces eye strain and improves visual comfort by blocking 50% of the blue light emitted from the display (in the 390nm - 440nm wavelength range).<br/><br/>The StarTech.com Advantage<br/>',28,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/71/50/7150455367fd495f6a8342b25fd6d84a/2000x2000/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/71\\/50\\/7150455367fd495f6a8342b25fd6d84a\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/27\\/98\\/27981107d7f260a4d48fa598928f3673\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/2d\\/1c\\/2d1c706a2414738980c8c60576c35d03\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/03\\/a0\\/03a054a457a979ff6349a1ca5b3d4eaf\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/e8\\/8d\\/e88d7e420c112020b930e1cd0e0db0ba\\/2000x2000\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/95\\/a4\\/95a41ab9b7981c8d499791df09c38a34\\/400x400\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":22.16,\"net\":26.59}',2,2,18208,22,'2025-08-20 14:19:03','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:25:30','2025-09-02 14:25:30'),(31537,'SM-F766BZKGEUB','SM-F766BZKGEUB','samsung-galaxy-z-flip7-black-flip-6gb-and-more-4-and-more-android-5g-dual-camera-256gb-and-more-sm-f766bzkgeub','Samsung Galaxy Z Flip7','Pocket-Perfect AI<br>Introducing our thinnest and most advanced Galaxy Z Flip ever â€” unparalleled beauty and performance that seamlessly fits your lifestyle and your pocket. The expanded cover screen is show-stopping from edge to edge, and it\'s all housed in durable body that\'s slimmer both folded or unfolded.<br><br>Ultra sleek. Ultra pocketable<br>Galaxy Z Flip7\'s redesigned cover screen features our slimmest bezel yet, enabling you to do more from FlexWindow than ever before. The stunning main screen now features an undisrupted viewing experience. It\'s a sight to behold.<br><br>Our thinnest yet durable Flip<br>The strong and light Armor Aluminium frame protects your Galaxy Z Flip7. And, our innovative Armor FlexHinge closes thinner while protecting your device. Strong protection with CorningÂ® GorillaÂ® Glass VictusÂ® 2.<br><br>Share-worthy selfies, hands-free<br>Enjoy richer, more detailed selfies that you can preview on our larger FlexWindow. You can even instantly apply AI learning-based custom filters to add finishing touches to your pics.<br><br>Max zoom. Max detail<br>Get super-clear, share-worthy pics from any distance. Powered by our ProVisual Engine, AI Zoom delivers stunning portraits whether you\'re taking selfies up-close, or going hands-free. Once you\'ve snapped your picture, AI will analyse and refine the details to produce crisp photos every time.<br><br>Bring details out of the dark<br>Capture breathtaking videos even in low light. The high-resolution sensor works together with our advanced ProVisual Engine that\'s built into the AP, to deliver richer contrast day or night.<br><br>Fastest, smoothest Galaxy Z Flip<br>Flip\'s advanced processor powers everything from the battery to the displays, ensuring that it works at the speed you need it to, for as long as you need it to. Whether you\'re streaming, gaming or editing your latest video.<br><br>Largest battery on Galaxy Z Flip<br>Our larger 4300 mAh battery and mDNIe technology have been optimised by our powerful processor so this Flip is ready for hours of uninterrupted entertainment.<br><br>Now Bar. Lock into the now<br>Now Bar, available right from the cover screen, gives you direct access to music that\'s playing, live notifications and more.<br><br>Stay ahead of your day with Now Brief<br>Receive a personalised rundown of your day from Now Brief right from the cover screen. Tailored insights, such as the latest weather and Energy Score, are all available at just a glance.<br><br>Your privacy, secured in the era of AI<br>Our Personal Data Engine gathers and processes your personal data safely. Then it encrypts that data and saves it onto your device with Knox Vault, making it harder for anyone else to gain access.<br><br>One UI 8. All new for Flip<br>Our best, most personalised UI was built from the ground up for both the main screen and the cover screen. With customisable wallpaper and interactive weather and gallery widgets, your Flip will be uniquely yours.<br><br>Connected living starts with Galaxy<br>Connect your Galaxy Z Flip7 with Galaxy Watch8 and other Galaxy devices for a seamless, smarter living experience.',1,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/56/01/560156b64fbf439e8cccf02884f17bb2/1094x1342/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/56\\/01\\/560156b64fbf439e8cccf02884f17bb2\\/1094x1342\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"}]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":669.12,\"net\":802.94}',2,26,10396,22,'2025-08-20 14:19:15','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:25:52','2025-09-02 14:25:52'),(31560,'SM-F966BZKNEUB','SM-F966BZKNEUB','samsung-galaxy-z-fold7-black-5g-triple-camera-clamshell-4-and-more-dual-sim-6gb-and-more-android-256gb-and-more-sm-f966bzkneub','Samsung Galaxy Z Fold7','Ultra Unfolds<br>Galaxy Z Fold7 exceeds your expectations of a smartphone. With a newly expanded 21:9 cover screen and even sleeker form, it\'s easier to hold and type on than ever so you can get things done comfortably. And the 8\" main screen is the most expansive screen on Galaxy smartphones.<br><br>Ultra 200 MP camera, now on Fold<br>Get super stunning, high-resolution shots with our powerful 200 MP camera that\'s perfectly paired with ProVisual Engine. Capture the finer points in every scene and let our next-gen ProVisual Engine do the rest. It will improve colour and details for clarity that enhances skin tones and textures.<br><br>Bring details out of the dark<br>Capture breathtaking videos even in low light. The high-resolution sensor works together with our advanced ProVisual Engine that\'s built into the AP, to deliver richer contrast day or night. Noise is also reduced so your shots stay sharp in the dark without the need to edit your videos later on.<br><br>The most powerful processor customised for Galaxy<br>Work at the speed you need with the most advanced SnapdragonÂ® mobile processor. This next-gen processor includes CPU, GPU and NPU enhancements for performance and AI. Plus, our pioneering mobile Digital Natural Image engine (mDNIe) ensures display quality without draining your battery.<br><br>Efficient battery powers all-day use<br>When you\'re out and about, it\'s important to be able to enjoy gaming, watching videos or multitasking without worrying about the battery. It\'s empowered with 4400 mAh and mDNIe technology for maximum power efficiency without draining battery life, to keep up with your busiest days.<br><br>Unrivaled immersive display<br>Enhance your everyday with the powerful Vision Booster. It detects environmental light and adapts screen colour and contrast. It can even reach 2600 nits of peak brightness â€” ensuring better outdoor viewing. And with advanced tone mapping, you get a clearer and more comfortable viewing experience.<br><br>Edit with detail side-by-side<br>Edit photos to your heart\'s content with side-by-side previews in Photo Assist. Just press and hold an object to move, erase or enlarge it, and adjust angles or fill backgrounds.<br><br>Personalised briefings with Now Brief<br>See how your day will unfold with Now Brief. Tailored insights, such as the latest weather and Energy Score, are all available at just a glance on the immersive main screen.<br><br>Simple summaries, smart organisation<br>Now you can easily organise and store large summaries from websites with Galaxy AI. Simply drag and drop into Notes app and save for later.<br><br>Your privacy, secured in the era of AI<br>Our Personal Data Engine gathers and processes your personal data safely. Then it encrypts that data and saves it onto your device with Knox Vault, making it harder for anyone else to gain access.',1.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":1774.25,\"net\":2129.1}',2,26,10396,22,'2025-08-20 14:19:15','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:25:58','2025-09-02 14:25:58'),(31561,'SM-F761BZKGEUB','SM-F761BZKGEUB','samsung-galaxy-z-flip7-fe-17-cm-67-dual-sim-android-160-5g-usb-type-c-8-gb-128-gb-4000-mah-black-flip-6gb-and-more-4-and-more-android-5g-dual-camera-dual-sim-android-16-0-128gb-to-256gb-black-galaxy-sm-f761bzkgeub','Samsung Galaxy Z Flip7 FE 17 cm (6.7\") Dual SIM Android 16.0 5G USB Type-C 8 GB 128 GB 4000 mAh Black','Samsung Galaxy Z Flip7 FE. Display diagonal: 17 cm (6.7\"), Display resolution: 2640 x 1080 pixels. Processor family: Samsung Exynos, Processor model: 2400. RAM capacity: 8 GB, Internal storage capacity: 128 GB. Rear camera resolution (numeric): 50 MP, Rear camera type: Dual camera. SIM card capability: Dual SIM. Operating system installed: Android 16.0. Battery capacity: 4000 mAh. Product colour: Black. Weight: 187 g',3,'https://images.shopcdn.co.uk/df/48/df4877d176c5c0166586120cd69c67b6/766x959/webp/resize?quality=80&compression=80','[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/df\\/48\\/df4877d176c5c0166586120cd69c67b6\\/766x959\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compression=80\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.shopcdn.co.uk\\/a1\\/ba\\/a1bad9e677f635eca2cee9557372c26e\\/200x120\\/webp\\/resize?quality=80&compressi