ing videos even in low light. The high-resolution sensor works together with our advanced ProVisual Engine that\'s built into the AP, to deliver richer contrast day or night.<br><br>Fastest, smoothest Galaxy Z Flip<br>Flip\'s advanced processor powers everything from the battery to the displays, ensuring that it works at the speed you need it to, for as long as you need it to. Whether you\'re streaming, gaming or editing your latest video.<br><br>Largest battery on Galaxy Z Flip<br>Our larger 4300 mAh battery and mDNIe technology have been optimised by our powerful processor so this Flip is ready for hours of uninterrupted entertainment.<br><br>Now Bar. Lock into the now<br>Now Bar, available right from the cover screen, gives you direct access to music that\'s playing, live notifications and more.<br><br>Stay ahead of your day with Now Brief<br>Receive a personalised rundown of your day from Now Brief right from the cover screen. Tailored insights, such as the latest weather and Energy Score, are all available at just a glance.<br><br>Your privacy, secured in the era of AI<br>Our Personal Data Engine gathers and processes your personal data safely. Then it encrypts that data and saves it onto your device with Knox Vault, making it harder for anyone else to gain access.<br><br>One UI 8. All new for Flip<br>Our best, most personalised UI was built from the ground up for both the main screen and the cover screen. With customisable wallpaper and interactive weather and gallery widgets, your Flip will be uniquely yours.<br><br>Connected living starts with Galaxy<br>Connect your Galaxy Z Flip7 with Galaxy Watch8 and other Galaxy devices for a seamless, smarter living experience.',35.00,NULL,'[]','{\"code\":1,\"cost\":853.44,\"net\":1024.13}',2,26,18389,22,'2025-08-20 14:19:20','2025-09-03 13:40:08','2025-09-02 14:26:25','2025-09-02 14:26:25'),(31940,'77-99691','77-99691','otterbox-symmetry-mobile-phone-case-17-cm-67-cover-black-apple-black-cover-case-77-99691','OtterBox 